<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walawi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Walawi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walawi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALAWI</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoleru</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha walawi shinyawitwi kwa lagalira ya Mlungu yakawapananiti Waisraeli kupitira Musa. Lilagaliru ali litakulira tambiku ya kulunguziwa na kwanja guwira munumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Shisoweru sha Walawi mana yakuyi “Ligoya lya Walawi” Likabira ali liweriti muisraeli. Lisyagulitwi na Mlungu kuwera watambika na walolela wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Shitamaduni, wafunda wajimira kuwera handa shitabu ashi sha Walawi na vitabu vyamonga vigona ndo avi Lyanjiru, Kulawa, Walanga na Liholu lya Lagiru) Shilembitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu Musa. Avi hatwizi kuviwona mvipandi vyavilisyaguliti vyeni, toziya mirandu ya Walawi yanja kwa kulonga shisoweru sha Mlungu shimyoweleriti Musa (Wala 1:1) wamonga wajimira handa vitabu vimonga viweriti vipatikaniti muvisoweru vya kwanja mukarini ya 5-6 pamberi pa Yesu kwiwuka Mubabiloni. Mushanjiru sha shitabu ashi sha Lawi hatubetuli kuusu litambiku lya kulunguziya. Gamonga galii Mlungu kulagalira kwa Wambuyi wakuyi. Zimu za tambiku zilawirana na vidoda vya wantu na tambiku zimonga zilaviwitwi kwa wantu wamonga toziya wantu wamfira Mlungu. Mushira shintu, shashiweriti sha mana kwa muntu kulaviya tambiku, pota likosa. Ayi ilanguziya ntambu ya uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu. Shipandi sha upeleru sha shitabu shilanguziya ntambu gaa Waisraeli na wambuyi wa Mtuwa Mlungu wasigaliti, waherepa ama wiziti kuwera waherepa. Mana nkulu ya shitabu ashi sha Mlungu ndo uweru na shitabu ashi shifata Lagiru. Waisraeli walikaliti kwa makakala ga Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 1 mpaka sha 7 shilaviya lagalira na ntambu ya kulaviya tambiku.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 8 mpaka sha 10 shilonga ntambu gaa Aruni na wana wakuyi wasyagulitwi kuwera wambuyi wa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 11 mpaka 16 shilanguziya Lagiru kuusu shiboga shiherepa na shiboga shidoda viraa na malweri.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi ashi sha 17 mpaka 27 shitakulira malagalira gamonga kuusu ntambu ya kuliya shiboga na misambu, ntambu iherepa na vinja vya kwoyera.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Tambiku za kulunguziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Musa kapikaniriti liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kulawa Muliringu Linanagala, palimgambira, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli handa muntu pakafira kumlavilira malaviwu Mtuwa Mlungu, hakalaviyi nkanyama kulawa mushipinga sha wang'ombi ama wakondolu ama wambuzi.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Handa tambiku yakalaviya muntu iwera ya kulunguziya, yomberi kafiruwa kamsyaguli nkanyama gwa shipalu yakahera shidoda shoseri kulawa mushipinga shakuwi, yomberi hakamlaviyi paligomi lya liringu linanagala su kajimiluwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Muntu hakatuli liwoku pamtuwi pa nkanyama gwa tambiku, pagutenda hangu tambiku ayi hayijimilwi kwajili ya kumlekeziya vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Shakapanu yomberi hakamlikituli mtuwi ng'ombi ulii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Su watambika waleri wa Aruni, womberi hawatoli mwazi na kugumishira pashitalawanda sha kutambikira wega zakuyi zoseri pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Muntu ayu hakamwambuli nkanyama ayu na kumhanjangahanjanga vipandi vipandi. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Wana walii wa mtambika Aruni, hawazituli weri mbawu pampindi pa shitalawanda sha kutambikira na kukoziya motu. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Shakapanu womberi hawatoli vipandi vilii vya nkanyama, mtuwi na lipaki na kuvitula pambawu za shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Kumbiti utumbu pamuhera na magulu ga kumbeli ga nkanyama ulii, muntu hakavigululi kwa mashi. Mtambika hakailunguziyi tambiku yoseri pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. Tambiku ayi ununkira wakuyi haumuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />Handa tambiku yakuyi ya kulunguziya hakayilaviyi kulawa mushipinga sha wakondolu ama wambuzi, yomberi hakamsyaguli nkanyama gwa shipalu yakahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Su hakamlikituli mtuwi nkanyama ulii uwega wa kushana kwa shitalawanda sha kutambikira kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, wana wa mtambika Aruni hawagumishiri mwazi wega zoseri za shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Muntu ayu hakamhanjangi vipandi vipandi, mtambika hakavituli weri mtuwi pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi na hakavituli pamotu pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Kumbiti utumbu pamuhera na magulu gakuyi ga kumbeli hakavigululi kwa mashi. Mtambika hakavilunguziyi vyoseri pashitalawanda, na tambiku ayi ya kulunguziya hayimuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />Paiwera kankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziya ya wampongu, yomberi hakajegi tambiku yakuyi ya nkunda ama mpongu teteri. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Mtambika hakamjegi mpongu ulii pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, yomberi hakamnyofoli mtuwi gwakuyi na kukilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. Mwazi gwakuyi hakagumishili mumbwega mwa shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Liholeru lya mpongu ulii pamuhera na uhakata wakuyi woseri hakaviwusiyi na kuvyasira uwega kwagulawa mshenji mwa shitalawanda sha kutambikira, palitulwa livu. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Hakamkoli mbapatiru mpongu ulii na kumpagula, kumbiti nakamhanjanga vipandi viwili. Shakapanu mtambika hakamlunguziyi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. Ununkira wa tambiku ayi haumuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Kulaviya tambiku za viboga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />Muntu yoseri pakajega tambiku za viboga kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, tambiku ayi iweri ya ubumu unama. Yomberi hakautuliri lipaki lya mizyetuni pamuhera na ubani, <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />shakapanu hakawajegeli wana wa mtambika Aruni. Mtambika hakatoli liwoku limu lya viboga vya ubumu unama awu yauwera na lipaki lya mizyetuni pamuhera na ubani na kuwulunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, su iweri handa seemuu ya liholu mushitalawanda sha kutambikira. Na tambiku ayi hayimuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Viboga vya tambiku vyavisigaliti haviweri vya Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi. Ayi hayiweri seemuu nanagala nentu ya tambiku yakalavilirwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />Handa muntu kankulavilira Mlungu tambiku ya viboga yawaibanika mushifinja, tambiku ayi hayiweri ya mabumunda yawalekera ndiri simika ya ubumu yayihanganywa na lipaki lya mizyetuni, ama maandazi yagalekerwa ndiri simika ama kutulirwa lipaki. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Payiwera tambiku yagulaviya iwera ya mabumunda gawabanika mushiwiga, ayi hayiweri ya ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi na lipaki lya mizyetuni pota kulekera simika. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Mabumunda aga hawagamegi vipandi vipandi na kuvitulira lipaki mushiwiga, ayi hayiweri tambiku ya viboga.<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntambu yingi ya tambiku ya mabumunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Handa tambiku yaku yagulaviya iwera ya viboga vyavitelekitwi mushiwiga, ayi hayiweri ya ubumu unama yaulekerwa lipaki. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Hagujegi tambiku ya viboga yainyawitwi kwa vintu avi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su mtambika hakaijegi kushitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Mtambika hakatoli seemu ya tambiku ayi payiwera ndo tambiku ya liholu na kuyilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira na kununkira kwakuyi hakumuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Seemu ya viboga vya tambiku vyavisigariti haviweri vya Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, viboga avi haviweri vinanagala nentu ya tambiku yawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />Tambiku yoseri ya viboga yagumjegera Mtuwa Mlungu, ifiruwa iweri inyawiwi pota simika, tembera kwahera ulekeziwu nakamu kulekera simika ama lwashi mutambiku yawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Guweza kumjegera Mtuwa Mlungu viboga vyaku vya kwanja kukamala kuwera tambiku. Kumbiti nagulavilira mushitalawanda sha kutambikira handa ununkira wa kuherepeziya. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Gutuli munu mutambiku zaku zoseri za viboga. Nakamu naguleka kutula munu mutambiku zaku za viboga, toziya munu guwera lilangaliru lya lipatanu lyakatenditi Mlungu pamuhera na mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Pagumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya mikunguwi ya viboga vyaku vya kwanja kulera, hagulaviyi ayi payiwera wailunguziya nakamu mumotu, payiwera mumikunguyi yakuyi, ama hagugalaviyi mabumunda yagabanikitwi na yawayinyawiti kwa nganu yawasyagiti. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Hagutuli lipaki lya mizyetuni na kutula ubani, ayi iwera tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Mtambika hakayilunguziyi nakamu seemu ya tambiku ayi ya viboga yayiponditwi pamuhera na lipaki na ubani wakuyi woseri, viweri tambiku ya kulihola, ayi iwera tambiku yawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga kulikolera mawoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />Handa muntu kankulaviya tambiku ya ponga, tambiku yakuyi payiwera ng'ombi gwashipalu ama gwashidala, nkanyama ayu nakawera na shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Yomberi hakatuli liwoku lyakuyi pampindi pa mtuwi gwa nkanyama ulii na kumlikitula pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. Watambika yawawera wana wa Aruni hawashimishiri shitalawanda sha kutambikira mwazi gwakuyi wega zakuyi zoseri. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Mutambiku ya ponga yakalavilirwa Mtuwa Mlungu, tambiku ayi hayilunguziwi kwa motu. Tambiku ayi hayiweri ya lipaki lilii lyaligubika utumbu wa nkanyama, ama yaligubika vintu vya mngati mwa nkanyama ulii. <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Viraa hakalaviyi figu mbili na lipaki lyakuyi pamuhera na seemu ilii iherepa ya litoga. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Watambika hawayilunguziyi nakamu pashitalawanda shakutambikira pamuhera na tambiku ya kulunguziya nakamu yaiwera pampindi pa mbawu, ayi iwera tambiku yakulunguziya nakamu kwa motu yayiwera na ununkira uherepa wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />Handa kondolu ama mbuzi kawera tambiku ya ponga, kaweri gwashipalu ama gwashidala kumbiti mpaka kaweri kahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Handa muntu pakalaviya mwana gwa kondolu kuwera tambiku, su hakalaviyi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />pakatula liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi na kumlikitula mtuwi nkanyama ulii kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. Watambika hawagumishiri mwazi gwakuyi muwega zoseri za msheshi za shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Shakapanu kulawa mutambiku ayi ya ponga yawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu, yomberi hakamlaviliri lipaki lya nkanyama ulii na mshila yaguwera na lipaki yagudumulitwi kulawa pakwegera nentu na uti gwa mgongu pamuhera na lipaki lyoseri lyaligubika utumbu pamuhera na lipaki lyoseri lyaliwera muutumbu, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />figu mbili zilii na lipaki lyakuyi pamuhera na seemu iherepa ya matoga. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Mtambika hakavilunguziyi vyoseri avi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira handa shiboga shawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />Handa tambiku yeni payiwera mbuzi, su hakamjegi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />pakatula liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ayu na kumlikitula kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. Wana wa Aruni hawagumishiri mwazi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira wega zakuyi zoseri. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Shakapanu lipaki lyoseri lyaligubika utumbu <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />figu mbili pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi na seemu iherepa ya matoga, yomberi hakamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziya kwa motu. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Mtambika hakavilunguziyi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira handa shiboga shawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu kulaviya ununkira wa kumuherepeziya Mlungu. Lipaki lyoseri liwera lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Ali liwera lilagaliru lyalifiruwa kujimirwa na gwenga pamuhera na shiyuwuku shaku mashaka goseri, poseri pamulikala. Namuliya lipaki ama mwazi gwa nkanyama yoseri ulii.<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagaliriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli, muntu yoseri pakatenda vidoda pota na kuvimana na kutenda shintu shashilewelelitwi kwa lagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakatendi aga.<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />Handa Mtambika Mkulu pakatenda vidoda, ata pakajega makosa toziya ya wantu na kalaviyi vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi na kumsengeziya kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ng'ombi gwa shipalu mdidini mkamilika, kuwera ndo malaviwu ga vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Yomberi hakamjegi mwana gwa ng'ombi pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su hakatuli liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi gwa ng'ombi ulii na kumlikitula kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Shakapanu Mtambika Mkulu hakatoli mwazi shididini gwa ng'ombi ulii na kugujega Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Hakajwiki shyala shakuyi mumwazi agu na kugumishira mala saba kulongolu kwa lipaziya lya Pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Shakapanu mtambika hakagutyelemeki mwazi agu mumagoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani yauwera na kununkira kuherepa, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu Muliringu Linanagala. Mwazi yagusigaliti hakaguyitili pasi pa lyanjiru lya shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kulunguziya tambiku yayiwera pakwegera pa ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Shakapanu hakawusiyi lipaki lyoseri lya ng'ombi ayu gwa tambiku lya kuwusiya vidoda, lipaki lyoseri lyaligubika utumbu, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />na figu mbili pamuhera na lipaki lyaliwera panani pakuwi pamuhera na seemu iherepa ya matoga. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Watambika hawavitoli vintu vyoseri avi na kuvilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, ntambu yakatenditi mutambiku ya ponga. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Kumbiti likuli lwa ng'ombi ayu na vinofu vyakuyi vyoseri pamuhera na mtuwi gwakuyi na magulu gakuyi na utumbu wakuyi na mapimba gakuyi, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />ng'ombi yoseri yakasigaliti, hakamjegi kunja kukambi pahala paherepa papajimirwa na Mtuwa Mlungu papawasilwa livu, yomberi hakamlunguziyi motu pambawu, pahala palii papawasila livu.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />Handa wantu woseri wa Israeli watenda vidoda pota na kuvimana kwa kutenda vintu vyavilewelekitwi kwa lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi hawaweri na makosa, <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />palaa palii vidoda avi vimanikana, su wantu woseri hawalaviyi mwana gwa ng'ombi gwashipalu kaweri tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. Womberi hawamjegi Kuliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Shakapanu wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli hawatuli mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ulii, su hakalikitulwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Su Mtambika Mkulu hakajegi mwazi kidogu gwa ng'ombi ulii Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Yomberi hakashijwiki shyala shakuyi mumwazi na kugumishira kulongolu kwa lipaziya mala saba, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Shakapanu mwazi gumonga hakagutyelemeki mumagoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira shashiwera Muliringu Linanagala kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Mwazi gwagusigaliti hakagwitili pasi pa shikaliru sha shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani shashiwera pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Lipaki lyoseri lya nkanyama ulii hakalitoli na kulilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Mtambika hakamtenderi ng'ombi ulii gambira ng'ombi gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda ntambu yakamtendiriti. Su mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku kwajili ya kuwusiya vidoda vyawu na womberi hawalekeziwi vidoda vyawu vyawatenditi. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Shakapanu hakatoli vintu vyavisigaliti vya ng'ombi ulii kunja kukambi na kumlunguziya kwa motu ntambu yakatenditi kwa nkanyama ulii yumonga. Ayi iwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vya shipinga sha wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />Mkulu pakatenda vidoda pota kuvimana kwa kutenda shintu shashilewelelitwi kwa lilagaliru lya Mtuwa, Mlungu gwakuyi, yomberi hakaweri kakosa. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Yomberi pakavimana shidoda shakatenditi, su hakajegi kumlaviya mbuzi gwashipalu yakahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Hakatuli liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi gwa mbuzi ulii na kumlikitula pahala pawalikitula tambiku za kulunguziya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ayi hayiweri tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Mtambika hakajwiki shyala shakuyi mumwazi gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na kugatyemeleka magoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Na mwazi gwagusigala hakagwitili pasi pa shikaliru sha shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Lipaki lyoseri lya mbuzi ulii hakalilunguziyi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, ntambu yakatenditi mulipaki lya nkanyama gwa tambiku ya ponga. Su mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku ayi na mkulu ulii hakalekeziwi vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />Na muntu yoseri pakati pa wantu wa Israeli pakatenda vidoda pota kuvimana, kwa kutenda shintu shashilewerituwi kwa lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu na vimtenda kaweri na kosa, <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />pakavimana vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi, yomberi hakajegi tambiku yakuyi ya mbuzi gwashidala yakahera shidoda shoseri kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyakatenditi. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Yomberi hakatuli liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi gwa mbuzi ulii gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, hakamlikituli pahala pawalikitula wankanyama wa tambiku ya kulunguziwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Shakapanu mtambika hakajwiki shyala shakuyi mumwazi gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na kugatyemeleka magoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Mwazi yagusigala hakagwiti pasi pa shikaliru sha shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Lipaki lyoseri lya mbuzi ulii gwashidala hakaliwusiyi ntambu yakaliwusiyiti lipaki lya wankanyama wa tambiku za ponga, su mtambika hakalilunguziyi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira na nunkira yakuyi hayimuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu. Su mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku kwajili ya muntu ayu na yomberi hakalekeziwi vidoda vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />Handa muntu pakamjega mwana gwa kondolu kaweri tambiku yakuyi ya ponga, su yomberi hakajegi mwana gwa kondolu gwashidala yakahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Yomberi hakatuli liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ulii gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, hakamlikituli pahala palii pawalikitula wankanyama wa tambiku ya kulunguziwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Shakapanu mtambika hakajwiki shyala shakuwi mumwazi gwa nkanyama gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na kugutyemeleka mumagoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Mwazi yagusigaliti hakagwitili mushikaliru sha shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Su mtambika hakaliwusiyi lipaki lyoseri ntambu yakaliwusiyiti lipaki lya mwana gwa kondolu gwa tambiku ya ponga, mtambika hakaliwunguziyi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, pamuhera na tambiku zyawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Na mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku kwajili ya muntu ayu na yomberi hakalekeziwi vidoda vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vya ntambu yingi yingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />Tambiku za kuwusiya vidoda zifiruwa kutenderwa hangu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 5:1">Handa muntu yoseri pakatenda vidoda toziya kasinda kulaviya ukapitawu kuusu shilii shakawoniti ama kushipikanira, su azabu ayi hayiweri kwa muntu ayu.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Ama muntu yoseri pakati penu pakashinkula shintu shashiwera shihumba, pashiwera mzoga gwa nkanyama gwa mutundu ama nkanyama gwa kulolerwa ama wavigongolu, muntu ayu hakaweri na likosa.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Ama muntu yoseri pakashinkula shintu shoseri sha muntu shashiwera shihumba, shintu shoseri sashimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba, pakatenda pota na kuvimana, kumbiti pakavimana yomberi hakaweri na likosa.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />Ama muntu yoseri pakalirapa kwa kutenda shintu shoseri shilii, shiheri ama shidoda pota kulihola, pakavimana shilii shakatenditi, yomberi hakaweri na likosa.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />Su muntu pakawera na likosa kuusu vitwatira avi kafiruwa kaleki vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />kamjegeri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku yakuyi ya kuwusiya vidoda. Toziya ya vidoda vyakatenditi yomberi hakajegi kondolu gwashidala ama mbuzi gwashidala kamlaviyi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. Mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku na yomberi hakalekeziwi vidoda vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />Kumbiti pakaweza ndiri kumlaviya mwana gwa kondolu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyakuyi, su hakajegi wankunda wawili ama wateteli wawili. Mpongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na yumonga kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Yomberi hawajegi kwa mtambika, mtambika hakamlaviyi mpongu yumu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda kwa kumumindula singu yakuyi, nakamnyofola mtuwi gwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Seemu ya mwazi gwakuyi hakagumishili mumbwega mwa shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Ayi hayiweri tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Shakapanu hakamlaviyi mpongu ulii gwa pili kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa kulawirana na malagaliru. Kwanjira ayi mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyakatenditi, su yomberi hakalekeziwi.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />Kumbiti pakasinda kulaviya wankunda wawili ama wateteli wawili kuwera tambiku yakuyi ya kuwusiya vidoda vyakatenditi, su yomberi hakajegi ubumu kilu yimu. Kumbiti hapeni kaulekeri lipaki ama ubani toziya ayi iwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Yomberi hakamjegeri mtambika, mtambika hakautoli ubumu ulii muliwoku lyakuyi limu kuulunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira kulanguziya tambiku yoseri iwera ya Mtuwa Mlungu, pamuhera na tambiku zyawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Ayi iwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Su mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku kwajili ya kuwusiya vidoda vya muntu ayu, na yomberi hakalekeziwi. Ubumu yausigaliti hauweri wa mtambika ntambu yaiweriti mutambiku ya viboga.<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya kulipira fidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />Muntu yoseri pakatenda vidoda pota kuvimana kuusu kulaviya ndiri vintu vinanagala vyakalaviliruwa Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakamjegi kondolu gwashipalu yakahera ndiri shidoda shoseri. Gwenga hagupimi samani yakuyi kulawirana na shipimu sha Pahala Pananagala. Ayi hayiweri tambiku ya kuwusiya likosa. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Viraa muntu ayu hakalipi vyoseri vyavilawiriti kuusu vintu vinanagala kwa kwongera seemu yimu ya vintu muhanu vya samani yakuyi na kumpanana yoseri mtambika. Su mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vya muntu kwa kondolu gwashipalu yakawera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, na yomberi hakalekeziwi.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />Muntu yoseri pakatenda vidoda pota kuvimana, kwa kuleka shashilagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakaweri na likosa, su hakalipi kwajili ya likosa lyakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Yomberi hakamjegeri mtambika kondolu gwashipalu yakahera ndiri shidoda shoseri, pakawera na samani teratera na samani ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. Mtambika hakamlaviliri tambiku kwa vidoda vyakatenditi, su yomberi hakalekeziwi. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Ayi iwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, yomberi kawera na likosa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />Handa muntu yoseri pakatenda vidoda na kuwera mwaminika ndiri kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa kumpayira muyaguwi mushitwatira shoseri shakapananitwi kushitula ama kumwiwira muyaguwi ama kumzulumu muyaguwi, muntu ayu hakaweri na likosa. <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />Ama muntu pakapata shintu sha muyagu shashiyagamiyiti na kulirapa kuwera gushiwona ndiri, ama gulirapa kwa upayira ama gutenda vidoda vyamonga vyoseri virii, yomberi kawera na likosa. <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />Muntu ayu pakatenda vidoda na kawera na ukontola, su kafiruwa kawuziyi shilii shakawiwiti ama shakapatiti kwa zuluma ama shilii shashitulituwi shakapananitwi ama shintu sha gwapakwegera gwakuyi shashyagamiyiti kashipatiti. <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />Ama shintu shoseri shakalirapiriti kwa upayira, hakawuziyi kila shintu kwa ukamilika na kwongera seemu yimu paseemu muhanu ya samani yakuyi. Kamkamu pakamana likosa lyakuyi hakamwuziliri mweni. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Shakapanu hakamjegeri mtambika kondolu gwashipalu yakahera shidoda shoseri kamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kuwusiya likosa. Samani ya nkanyama ayu hayiweri teratera na ilii yaitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vilii kwa Mtuwa Mlungu toziya ya kumpunga muntu ayu, su yomberi hakalekeziwi vidoda vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya kulunguziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />Gumlagaliri Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi visoweru avi. Malagairu aga ndo ga kulaviya tambiku. Tambiku ya kulunguziya hayiweri pamotu pashitalawanda sha kutambikira pashiru poseri mpaka mandawira na motu gwakuyi nagutenda tiya. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Shakapanu mtambika hakavali shati ntali mfufu na kaputura yakuyi yailawirana na nguwu mfufu, hakatoli livu lya tambiku ilii kulawa pashitalawanda na kugatula mumbwega mwa shitalawanda shilii. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Su pakavula nguwu za utambika na kuvala nguwu zakuyi, hakagajegi malivu galii kunja kwa kambi pahala paherepa. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Motu gwa mushitalawanda sha kutambikira gufiruwa gwendereyi kwaka nagutenda tiya. Kila mandawira mtambika hakatuli mbawu mumotu agu na pashitalawanda hakatuli tambiku za kulunguziya, pamberi pa kulunguziya lipaki lya tambiku lya ponga. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Motu hagwendereyi kwaka shaka shoseri nagutenda tiya.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matakuliru gamonga kuusu tambiku ya viboga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />Aga ndo malagaliru gamonga ga tambiku za viboga. Wana wa Aruni hawamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu kulongolu kwa shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Yumu gwa watambika hakatoli liwoku limu lya ubumu wa tambiku ya shiboga shimu pamuhera na lipaki na ubani woseri na kuvilunguziya pashitalawanda kulanguziya kuwera tambiku yoseri iwera ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Ununkira awu haumuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Ubumu yausigaliti Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawautoli na kunyawa mabumunda pota kulekera simika. Kumbiti womberi wafiruwa waliyi gambira mabumunda yagalekeruwa ndiri simika pahala pananagala mumdamu Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Nagubanika mabumuna yagalekerwa simika. Niwapanani womberi seemu ayi kulawa mutambiku zawandavilira kwa motu. Ziwera tambiku nanagala nentu, ntambu yaziwera tambiku za kuwusiya vidoda pamuhera na kuwusiya makosa. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Wana wapalu wa Aruni gweka yawu ndo walekeziwa kuliya seemu ayi, toziya seemu ayi itulwa gweka vyaka vyoseri kwajili yawu kulawa mutambiku zyawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Yoseri yakazishinkula tambiku azi kaweri mnanagala, paiwera ndiri hangu hakahowi.<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />gumgambiri Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kuwera tambiku azi womberi wafiruwa wazijegi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera yumu gwawu pakawera mtambika. Muntu kafiruwa kajegi kilu yimu ya ubumu unama kwa lishaka, nusu yimu ya ubumu awu haulaviwi mandawira na umonga haulaviwi pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Ubumu awu hauhanganyiwi pamuhera na lipaki na kubanikuwa, shakapanu haujeguwi pauwera vipandi vipandi na kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, ununkira wa tambiku yakuyi haumuherepeziyi Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Ndagalira kuwera mwana gwa Aruni, yoseri yakasyagulwa kuwera Mtambika Mkulu pa Aruni kuhowa, yomberi kafiruwa kutandira vintu vyoseri avi vya tambiku ya viboga. Ali liwera lilagaliru lya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Tambiku yoseri ya viboga yailaviwa na mtambika hayilunguziwi yoseri, hapeni wailiyi nakamu.<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matakulliru kuusu tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Mtuwa Mungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />gumgambiri Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kuwera aga ndo malagaliru ga tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. Nkanyama gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda hakalikitulwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pahala palii nkanyama gwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa pawamlikitulaga, su pahala panu nkanyama ayu gwa kuwusiya vidoda hakalikitulwi, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, tambiku ayi iwera nanagala nentu. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Mtambika yakalaviya tambiku ayi ndo ulaa mweni hakaliyi vinofu. Tambiku ayi hawailiyi pahala pananagala, mumdamu gwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Shoseri shashishinkula vinofu avi shiweri shinanagala, pashiwera ndiri hangu hashifuwi. Na nguwu yoseri payitulukilwa na mwazi gwa nkanyama gwa tambiku ayi, su nguwu ayi hayigululwi pahala pananagala. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Tambiku ayi payitelekwa muviwiga, viwiga avi vifiruwa vipantwu. Kumbiti viwiga avi paviwera vya shaba, su viwiga avi havigululwi weri na kuvisuwuza kwa mashi. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Mpalu yoseri gwa shiyiwuku sha watambika gweka yawu walekeziwa kuliya tambiku ayi toziya iwera tambiku nanagala nentu. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Kumbiti payiwera mwazi gwa tambiku yoseri ya kuwusiya vidoda pagujegwa Muliringi Linanagala, tambiku ya nkanyama ulii nawailiya. Tambiku ayi hayilunguziwi kwa motu.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya kuwuzilira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />Malagaliru aga gawera ga tambiku ya kuwuzilira, tambiku ayi iwera nanagala nentu. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Nkanyama gwa tambiku ya kuwuzilira, hakalikitulwi pahala pawalikitulwa wankanyama wa kulunguziya, mwazi gwakuyi hagumishirwi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira muwega zakuyi zoseri. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Lipaki lyakuyi lyoseri, lipaki lya mshira pamuhera na galii yagagubika utumbu, havilaviwi na kulunguziwa <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />pamuhera na zilii figu mbili na lipaki lyakuyi na seemu ilii iherepa ya matoga. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Mtambika hakavilunguziyi vintu virii pashitalawanda handa tambiku yakalavilirwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Ayi iwera tambiku ya kuwuzilira. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Wapalu woseri wa kaya ya watambika walekeziwa kuiliya tambiku ayi, kumbiti wafiruwa kuiliya Muliringu Linanagala toziya ndo pahala papawera pananagala. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Lagiru liwera limu lya kuwuzilira na lilagaliru lya kuwusiya vidoda. Mtambika yakalaviya tambiku ya kukolaniziya mawoku, hakavitoli vinofu avi. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Mtambika yakalaviya tambiku ya kulunguziya kwajili ya muntu yoseri, hakatoli likuli lya nkanyama yakalaviwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Tambiku yoseri ya viboga yaibanikwa mulitanulu lya motu ama yaitelekwa mushiwiga, tambiku hayiweri ya mtambika yakalaviya. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Kila tambiku ya viboga payihanganyikitwi na lipaki ama payitelekitwi ndiri, hayiweri ya wana wa Aruni, su woseri walibagulirani teratera.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagiru gamonga ga tambiku za ponga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Malagaliru aga gawera ga tambiku za ponga, zyeni muntu kaweza kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Payiwera muntu kankulaviya tambiku ya ponga ya kulonga mayagashii Mlungu, su hakalaviyi vinofu vya nkanyama pamuhera na maandazi geni ubumu wakuyi ulekerwa ndiri simika na uhanganyikitwi na lipaki, mabumunda yagatyelemekwa lipaki pamuhera na maandazi ga ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi na lipaki. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ayi ya ponga ya kulonga mayagashii Mlungu, yomberi hakajegi maandazi yagalekerwa simika. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Kulawirana na maandazi aga, yomberi hakamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu andazi limu kulawa mukila ntambu msheshi za maandazi, maandazi aga hagaweri ga mtambika yakamishira mwazi gwa tambiku ya ponga pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Vinofu vya tambiku ayi ya ponga na kulonga mayagashii Mlungu, womberi hawailiyi lishaka lilaa ali pawalaviya tambiku. Hapeni kaleki ata seemu yakuyi mpaka mandawira.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />Kumbiti tambiku ayi ya ponga payiwera malawiranu ga kulirapira kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ama ya ntambu hera, tambiku ayi hawailiyi lishaka lilaa ali pawayilaviya na tambiku yaisigala hawawezi kuyiliya shilawu yakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Kumbiti tambiku ayi payisigala mpaka lishaka lya tatu, hayilunguziwi. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Handa vinofu vyoseri vya tambiku ya ponga pawayiliya lishaka lya tatu, hapeni ijimirwi, viraa hapeni iwankwi kwa mota ya muntu yakayilaviya. Vinofu avi viwera nkalaliru na muntu yakavilaya hapeni kalekeziwi likosa lyakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Shinofu shoseri sha tambiku ya ponga shashishinkula shintu shihumba, nawashiliya. Shinofu ashi hashilunguziwi kwa motu. Woseri yawawera waherepa waweza kuliya vinofu vyamonga <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />vyavilaviwa tambiku ya ponga kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Kumbiti muntu yoseri yakawera muhumba, pakaliya vinofu avi vya tambiku ya ponga, yomberi hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Handa muntu yoseri pakashinkula shintu shoseri shashiwera shihumba, ama shintu shihumba kulawa kwa muntu, ama nkanyama yakawera muhumba, ama shintu shoseri shihumba shashiwera shikalaliru, pakaliya vinofu vya tambiku ya ponga yakavilitwi Mtuwa Mlungu, muntu ayu hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />guwagambiri wana wa Israeli, namliya lipaki lyoseri lya ngo'mbi ama lya kondolu ama lya mbuzi. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Lipaki lyoseri lya nkanyama yakafuwiti mweni ama nkanyama yakalaguwitwi na nkanyama gwa kuntundu, viweza kutuluwa kwa vitwatira vyamonga, kumbiti nakamu namuliya. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Muntu yoseri yakaliya lipaki lya nkanyama yakalaviwitwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu, yomberi hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Kayi nakamu namuliya mwazi goseri gulii, mwazi gwa mpongu ama gwa nkanyama pahala poseri pamulikala. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Muntu yoseri yakaguliya mwazi, muntu ayu hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa,<verse eid="LEV 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu, Muntu yoseri pakalaviya tambiku ya ponga kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakampanani Mtuwa Mlungu seemu ya tambiku ayi. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Hakamjegeri kwa mawoku gakuyi mweni handa tambiku ya kulunguziya kwa motu. Viraa hakajegi lipaki lyakuyi pamuhera na mbavi hakavinyasuli kumpindi su kulanguziya kankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Mtambika hakalilunguziyi lipaki ali pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, kumbiti luwavu haluweri lwa Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Liwondu lya kumliwu lya kumbeli lya nkanyama gwa tambiku za mwenga za ponga hamumpanani mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Liwondu lya kumliwu ali haliweri lya mtambika yakawera mwana gwa Aruni yakalaviya mwazi gwa tambiku ya ponga na lipaki lyakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagalira wantu wa Israeli watuli gweka luwavu alu na liwondu ali lya nkanyama gwa tambiku zawu za ponga, wampanani mtambika Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, toziya seemu ayi watulilwa watambika mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Seemu ayi ndo ilii yayitulitwi gweka kwajili ya Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kulawa mutambiku zyakalavilirwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu, kwanjira lishaka lyawatyekitwi kwa kuswagwa lipaki kuwera watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Pawatyekitwi kwa kuswagwa lipaki, Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagaliriti wana Israeli wawapanani seemu ayi ya tambiku, toziya hayiweri seemu yawu mashaka goseri.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Su aga ndo malagalira ga tambiku ya kulunguziya, tambiku ya viboga na tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na tambiku ya kuwuzilira na tambiku lya kutyekuwa na tambiku ya ponga. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti Musa malagaliru aga mulugongu lwa Sinayi lishaka lilii pakawalagaliriti wantu wa Israeli wamjegeri tambiku zawu, kulii kushiwala sha Sinayi.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s">Kutyekwa kwa Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Kulawa 29:1-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />guwashemi Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi wizi kuligomi lya Liringu Linanagala kulongolu kwa neni, watoli nguwu zawu nanagala na lipaki lya kutyeka na ng'ombi gwa kulaviya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na wakondolu wawili washipalu na lijamanda lya mabumunda yagalekerwa ndiri simika. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Shakapanu guwajojonili wantu woseri wa Israeli wizi kulongolu kwa ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala.<verse eid="LEV 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Su Musa katenditi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi kawajojoniriti wantu woseri wa Israeli kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Musa kawagambiriti wantu woseri wa Israeli hangu, “Shitwatira ashi Mtuwa Mlungu kashilagalira shitendeki.”<verse eid="LEV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Shakapanu Musa kawajegiti Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, kawagulula kwa mashi. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Su kamvalisiyiti Aruni lihabiti na kumtawa lufunga mushunu shakuyi, shakapanu kamvalasiya lihabiti na shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika luwavu. Kamtawiti mushunu shakuyi lufunga lwalukolaniziwitwi na shipandi sha nguwu ashi shashipotitwi weri. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Shakapanu kashitula shihaku pashifuwa sha Aruni na mushihaku ashi yomberi katuliti mabuwi mawili ga kutoza yagashemwa Urimu na Sumimu. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Kamvalasiya Aruni shilemba mumtuwi mwakuyi, uwega wa kulongolu wa shilemba katuliti lilembiziwu lya zahabu, lijenjieri linanagala gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Shakapanu Musa katola lipaki lya kutyelemeka na kulityelemeka Liringu Linanagala pamuhera na vintu vyakuyi vyaviweriti mkati mwakuyi na kavityeka. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Yomberi kamishiriti lipaki pashitalawanda malasaba, kavityelemekiti na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri na libeseni pamuhera na shikaliru shakuyi, vyoseri kavityekiti. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Viraa virii Musa kamiminiriti lipaki lya kumtyelemeka pamtuwi gwa Aruni na kumtyeka. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Shakapanu Musa kawajegiti wana wa Aruni na kuwavalisiya lihabiti na kuwatawa lufunga muvyunu mwawu na kuwavalisiya kofia ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Su Musa kamjegiti ng'ombi ulii gwashipalu gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watuliti mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa ng'ombi ulii. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Musa kamlikituliti ng'ombi ulii, kagutoliti mwazi kagatyelemekiti magoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira wega zoseri kwa shyala shakuyi kushipunga. Shakapanu kagutoliti mwazi yagusigaliti kagwitila pasi pa shikaliru sha shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Su kwanjira ayi yomberi kashityekiti shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Viraa Musa katoliti lipaki lyoseri lyaliweriti mumtima mwa ng'ombi ulii na matoga gaherepa na figu zoseri mbili pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi na kuvilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Kumbiti vinofu vya ng'ombi ulii pamuhera na likuli lyakuyi na mavi gakuyi, yomberi kagavilunguziyiti kwa motu kunja kwa kambi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Shakapanu Musa kamjegiti kondolu gwashipalu ulii gwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa, Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watuliti mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ayu. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Musa kamlikituliti na mwazi gwa kondolu ulii kagumishiriti wega zoseri za shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Yomberi kamlikitula kondolu ulii vipandi vipandi, su kavilunguziyiti pamuhera na mtuwi na lipaki lyakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Pamberi pa kulunguziya tambiku ilii, yomberi kagululiti kwa mashi matumbu na magulu ga kumbeli na seemu zyamonga za kondolu gwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa. Ayi iwera tambiku yakalavilirwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu, tambiku yaiwera na ununkira wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. Musa katenditi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Shakapanu Musa kamjega kondolu gwashipalu yumonga kwajili ya tambiku ya kutyeka. Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watuliti mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa kondolu ulii. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Musa kamlikitula kondolu ulii na kugutola mwazi gwakuyi na kumtyelemeka mulikutu lya kumliwu lya Aruni na mushyala shakuwi shikulu muliwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu na mushyala shikulu sha muligulu lyakuyi lya kumliwu. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Viraa Musa kawajegiti wana wa Aruni, kawaswagiti mwazi mukingu za makutu gawu ga kumliwu na musyala shikulu sha mawoku gawu ga kumliwu na mushyala shikulu sha magulu gawu ga kumliwu. Mwazi gumonga kagumishiriti wega zoseri za shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Shakapanu katoliti lipaki lyoseri, mshira pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi, lipaki lyoseri lyaligubika utumbu na seemu iherepa ya matoga pamuhera na figu zoseri mbili pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi na liwondu lya kumliwu lya kondolu ayu gwashipalu. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Su mulijamanda lya mabumunda yakakeleritwi ndiri simika, yagatulitwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi kalaviyiti libumunda limu lyalilekerwa ndiri simika, libumunda limu lyaliwera na lipaki na liandazi limu, kavituliti vyoseri pavipandi vya lipaki na liwondu lya ligulu lilii. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Musa kavituliti vintu virii mumawoku ga Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, su womberi wavinyasuliti kumpindi kulanguziya wankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Shakapanu Musa kavitoliti kayi vintu virii mumawoku mwawu na kuvilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, pamuhera na tambiku ya kulunguziwa. Ayi iweriti tambiku ya kutyekwa, tambiku yayiwera na ununkira wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu, tambiku yayilaviwa kwa motu. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Shakapanu Musa kalutola luwavu lulii na kulunyasula kumpindi kulanguziya kankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, seemu ayi ya kondolu ulii gwashipalu gwa kutyekuwa hakaweri gwa Musa ntambu yayilagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Musa katola viraa lipaki limonga lya kutyeka na mwazi waguweriti palii pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, kamumishiriti Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, kamishiriti na munguwu zawu.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Musa kawagambiriti Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, “Muvipwasiyi vinofu kulongolu kwa ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, muviliyi pakwegera na ligomi palii pamuhera na mabumunda kulawa mulijamanda lyaliwera na tambiku ya kutyekwa. Mtendi tambu yamlagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, seemu ayi hawayiliyi Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Vinofu vyoseri ama mabumunda goseri yagasigala, hagalunguziwi. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Hapeni mlawi kunja paligomi lya mdamu gwa Liringu Linanagala kwa shaka shoseri sha mashaka saba, mpaka shaka shenu shakutyekwa pashipera, shaka ashi hashiweri sha mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Shilii shatutenditi leru shilagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu su mwenga mlekeziwi vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Mwenga hamulikali paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala paluwala na pashiru kwa mashaka saba, pamuvitenda ndiri hamuhowi. Vitwatira avi ndagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Su Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watenditi kila shintu ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu yakalagaliriti kupitira Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi wankulaviya tambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Su liweriti lishaka lya nane, Musa kawashema Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi na wazewi wa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Musa kamgambiriti Aruni, “Gumtoli gwenga mwana gwa ng'ombi gwashipalu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na kondolu gwashipalu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa, wankanyama woseri nawawera na shidoda shoseri. Shakapanu guwalaviyi tambiku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Shakapanu guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli wamtoli mbuzi yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, na mwana gwa kondolu yumu yakawera na shinja shimu na yakahera shidoda shoseri kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Viraa gumtoli ng'ombi gwashipalu na kondolu yumu gwashipalu kwajili ya kulaviya tambiku ya ponga, wamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga yaihanganyiwitwi na lipaki toziya leru Mtuwa Mlungu hakawalawiri.” <verse eid="LEV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Wantu wa Israeli wavijegiti vintu vyoseri kulongolu Muliringu Linanagala gambira Musa ntambu yakawalagaliriti, shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli wagenditi kugoloka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Musa kawagambiriti, “Agu ndo mlandu gweni Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti wagutendi su uweru wakuyi uwoneki kwa mwenga.” <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />“Shakapanu Musa kamgambira Aruni, gushisegeleri shitalawanda sha kutambikira, gulaviyi tambiku yaku ya kuwusiya vidoda pamuhera na tambiku ya kulunguziwa, gulaviyi tambiku kwajili yaku gamweni na kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Su Aruni kashisegeleriti shitalawanda sha kutambikira, kamlikituliti mwana gwa ng'ombi yakamlaviyiti kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyakuyi mweni. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Shakapanu wana wa Aruni wamjegiriti mwazi, na Aruni kajobiti shyala shakuyi mumwazi gulii na kugatyemeleka magoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Mwazi yagusigaliti kagwitiliti mushikaliru sha shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Su lipaki na figu na lipaki lyaligubikiti figu na matoga, yomberi kavilunguziyiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Kumbiti likuli lwa nkanyama ulii kalilunguziyiti kwa motu kunja kwa kambi.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Shakapanu Aruni kamlikituliti nkanyama gwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa. Wana wakuyi wamjegiriti mwazi, na Aruni kagumishiriti pashitalawanda sa kutambikira muwega zoseri. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Viraa womberi wamjegeriti tambiku za kulunguziwa na shipandi kwa shipandi pamuhera na mtuwi, Aruni kavilunguziyiti pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Pamberi pa kulunguziya tambiku ilii, yomberi kagululiti utumbu na magulu na kugalunguziya pamuhera na tambiku ilii ya kulunguziwa pashitawanda sha kutambikira.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Shakapanu kazitula tambiku za wantu. Kamtoliti mbuzi gwa tambiku kwajili ya kuwusiya vidoda vya wantu, kamlikitula na kumlaviya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, ntambu yakatenditi kwa nkanyama ulii gwa kwanja. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Su katuliti tambiku ilii ya kulunguziwa na kalaviyiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Shakapanu katuliti tambiku ya viboga kamemiziya liwoku limu lya ubumu na kuvilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira pamuhera na tambiku ilii ya kulunguziwa ya kila mandawira.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Aruni kamlikituliti viraa ng'ombi gwashipalu na kondolu gwashipalu gwa tambiku ya ponga kwajili ya wantu. Wana wakuyi wamjegeriti mwazi kugumishira mushitalawanda sha kutambikira wega zakuyi zoseri. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Lipaki lya ng'ombi ulii pamuhera na lya kondolu gwashipalu ulii, mshira gwa kondolu na lipaki lyaligubikiti utumbu na figu na seemu iherepa ya matoga <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />womberi wavituliti pavifuwa vya wankanyama walii na yomberi kavinguziyiti lipaki lilii pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Kumbiti vifuwa virii na ligulu lulii lya kumbeli lya kumliwu, Aruni kavinyasuliti kumpindi kulanguziya kankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, gambira Musa ntambu yakalagaliriti.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Aruni pakamaliliti kulaviya tambiku zoseri, tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na tambiku ya kulunguziwa na tambiku za ponga, yomberi kawanyasuliriti wantu mawoku, kawapetiriti mashi shakapanu kasulukiti kulawa pashitalawanda shilii. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Shakapanu Musa na Aruni wingiriti Muliringu Linanagala, pawalawiti wawapetiriti mashi wantu, uweru wa ukulu wa Mtuwa Mlungu uwonekiti kwa wantu woseri. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Mtuwa Mlungu kagukoziyiti motu, gulunguziyiti tambiku ya kulunguziwa pamuhera na lipaki lyaliwera pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. Wantu woseri pawaguwoniti motu, wabotangiti kwa nemeleru na kusuntama makukama.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadabu na Abihu, wana wawili wa Aruni, womberi watoliti kila muntu shetezu shakuyi, watuliti makala ga motu pamuhera na ubani, womberi wamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu motu muhumba, motu gulii wagujimiluwa ndiri na malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Palaa palii motu gulawiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, guwalunguziyiti wantemba walii na wahowiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />“Su Musa kamgambiriti Aruni, mushitwatila ashi Mtuwa Mlungu kakulanguziya mana ya shilii shakatakuliti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">hanililanguziyi namweni kuwera Mnanagala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">pakati pa walii yawantendera neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">hankwiswi kulongolu kwa wantu woseri. Aruni kanyamaliti jii.”<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />“Shakapanu Musa kawashemiti Mishaeli na Elisafani, wana wa Uzieli, tati mpusu gwa Aruni, yomberi kawagambira, mwizi panu, muwusiyi mawuti galii ga walongu wenu na kugajega kunja kulugonjeru, kutali na pahala pa Liringu Linanagala.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Womberi watoliti mauti ga walongu wawu pawawapapa munguwu zyawavaliti walii yawahowiti na kugajega kunja kulugonjeru, gambira Musa ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="LEV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />“Shakapanu Musa kamgambira Aruni pamuhera na Eleazari na Itamari wana wakuyi, namuzitutulira nvili zenu ama kupapulaga nguwu zyenu kudaya, pamtenda hangu hamuhowi na kushijegera shipinga shoseri maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu. Kumbiti walongu wenu, shipinga shoseri sha wana wa Israeli waweza kudaya kwa woseri Mtuwa Mlungu pakawagamiziya kwa motu. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Namlawa kunja Kuliringu Linanagala, pamtenda hangu hamuhowi, toziya lipaki lya kutyekuwa lya Mtuwa Mlungu lyapanani panu. Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watenditi gambira Musa ntambu yakalongiti.”<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagiru lya watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Pamwingira Muliringu Linanagala, gwenga pamuhera na wana waku namlanda dongera ama ujimbi woseri ulii, pamtenda aga hamuhowi. Aga hagaweri malagaliru ga mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Mwenga mfiruwa muvimani weri galii yagawera mananagala na galii yagawera ndiri mananagala, vitwatira vihumba na virii vyaviwera ndiri vihumba. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Hamuwafundi wantu wa Israeli malagaliru goseri aga ganiwapananiti kupitira Musa.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />“Musa kawagambiriti Eleazari na Itamari wana wa Aruni yawasigaliti, mtoli seemu ya tambiku za viboga zilii zyazisigaliti kulawa mutambiku zyawamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Muiliyi pakwegera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira pota kulekera simika, toziya tambiku ayi iwera nanagala nentu. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Mwenga hamuliyi tambiku ayi mupahala pananagala, toziya tambiku ayi iwera yenu pamuhera na washiyiwuku shaku kulawa mutambiku zyawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Ayi ndo ntambu yandagalaritwi. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Kumbiti gwenga pamuhera na wana waku na wahinga waku mweza kuliya shidali pamuhera na ligulu vyavinyasulwa kumpindi kulanguziya kuwera vyankulaviwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Muliyi avi mupahala papajimiruwa na Mlungu. Vintu avi gupananwa gwenga kuwera seemu yaku pamuhera na washiyuwuku shaku kulawa mutambiku za ponga za wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Ligulu lilii lyalilaviritwi pamuhera na luwavu havinyasulwi kumpindi kulanguziya vityekwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, hawavijegi pamuhera na tambiku za lipaki zyazilaviwa kwa motu, su kutenda lilangaliru lya kuvilaviya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su viweri tambiku ya kulaviya lilangaliru. Avi haviweri pamuhera na wana waku, ayi hayiweri seemu ya mwenga mashaka goseri gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Musa pakalolitiloliti weri kuusu mbuzi yumu yakalaviyitwi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, yombeli kayambuliti kuwera kalaviyitwi kala kulunguziwa. Su kaweriti na maya nentu kwa Eleazari pamuhera na itamari wana wa Aruni yawasigaliti. Su Musa kawakosiya, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Iwera hashi mwenga muliyandiri tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda Muliringu Linanagala? Tambiku ayi iweriti nanagala nentu, mpananitwi mwenga tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda su Mtuwa Mlungu hakawalekeziyi vidoda vyawu vyawatenditi. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kayi mwazi gwakuyi gujegitwi ndiri Muliringu Linanagala, ifiruwitwi mwenga muiliyi pakwegera Mupahala Pananagala ntambu yailagaliritwi.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />“Aruni kamwankuliti Musa, guloli, leru walaviya tambiku zawu za kuwusiya vidoda na kulunguziya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti vitwatira gambira avi vindawiliti kala neni. Hashi Mtuwa Mlungu mekahelepeziwi handa neni mendiyi leru tambiku ayi ya kuwusiya vidoda?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Musa pakapikaniriti aga kaherepeziwitwi na yomberi.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s">Wakanyama yawawera wahumba na yawawera ndiri wahumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Liholu 14:3-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />muwagambiri wana wa Israeli hangu, wakanyama woseri yawalikala pasipanu, awa ndo yamuweza kuwaliya. <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Mwenga muweza kuliya nkanyama nyoseri ulii yakana kwatu yazibagulikiti pakati, viraa kahirula shilii shawaliyiti kala. <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Wankanyama awa namuwaliya, womberi wawuyira shilii shawaliyiti kala kumbiti kwatu za magulu gawu zibagulika ndiri pakati, ama walii kwatu zawu zibagulika pakati kumbiti wawuyira ndiri shilii shawaliyiti kala. Namumliya nkanyama ngamiya, toziya yomberi kawuyira shilii shakaliyiti kala kumbiti kwatu za magulu gakuyi galibagulana ndiri pakati. Nkanyama ayu kawera muhumba kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Nkanyama pimbi namumliya, toziya yomberi kawuyira kuliya shilii shakaliyiti kala kumbiti kwatu za magulu gakuyi galibagulana ndiri pakati, nkanyama ayu kawera muhumba kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Namumliya kambenga, toziya yomberi kankuwuyira kuliya shilii shakaliyiti kala, kumbiti kwatu za magulu gakuyi galibagulana ndiri pakati, nkanyama ayu kawera muhumba kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Namumliya mtumbi, toziya yomberi kwatu za magulu gakuyi zibagulika pakati, kumbiti yomberi kawuyira ndiri kuliya shilii shakaliyiti kala, nkanyama ayu kawera muhumba kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Toziya wankanyama awa wawera wahumba su namuliya vinofu vyawu ama kushinkula mawuti gawu.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Somba yoseri gwa mubahari ama mulushemba, ulii yakawera na malakalaka na makalakatu su muweza kumuliya. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Kumbiti shoseri shashilikala mubahari ama mulushemba, shilii shashiwera ndiri na malakalaka ama makalakatu, viumbi vyoseri vyaviwera mumashi pamuhera na viumbi vyamonga vyoseri, viwera vikalaliru kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Viumbi avi haviweri vikalaliru kwa mwenga mashaka goseri. Namuliya vinofu vyawu ama kushinkula mawuti gawu toziya wawera wakalaliru. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Shoseri shashilikala mumashi, shilii shashiwera ndiri na malakalaka pamuhera na makalakatu, shiwera shikalaliru kwa mwenga.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />Wampongu awa ndo wawera wakalaliru kwa mwenga, su namuwaliya. Mpongu ngashanga na furukombe na kapungu, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />shimbowi na shipanga na ntambu zoseri za shipanga <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />na ntambu zoseri za kunguru <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />na mpongu mbuni na lisisigira na tipitipi na ntambu zoseri za lisisigira <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />na lisisigira mdidika na mnandi na lisisigira mkulu <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />mumbi na mwari na mderi, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />kolongo na ntambu zoseri za koikoi na hudihudi na gombalima.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />Wang'ongolu woseri yawawera na mbapatiru na wagenda kwa magulu ga msheshi, womberi wawera wakalaliru kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Kumbiti wang'ongolu wamu yawawera na mbapatiru na wagendangenda kwa magulu ga msheshi ga kukopokera pasi, womberi muweza kuwaliya. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Wang'ongolu awa ndo kila ntambu za wanjombi na kila ntambu za senene na kila ntambu za vibatala na kila ntambu za matapa. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Kumbiti wang'ongolu wamonga woseri yawawera na mbapatiru na magulu ga msheshi, wawera nkalaliru kwa mwenga.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />Kushinkula wankanyama awa hakumtendi muntu kuwera muhumba, muntu yoseri yakashinkura mawuti gawu hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Muntu pakatola seemu ya mawuti gawu hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi, na nguwu zakuyi zifiruwa kugululwa. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Kila nkanyama yakawera na kwatu zyazibagulika pakati kumbiti kabakula ndiri kuliya shilii shaliyiti kala, muntu yoseri yakamshinkula nkanyama ayu hakaweri muhumba. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Wakanyama woseri yawagendagenda kwa viganja vyawu tembera wawera na magulu ga msheshi, hawaweri wahumba kwa mwenga, muntu yoseri yakashinkula mawuti ga wankanyama awa, su hawaweri wahumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Muntu yoseri yakapapa mawuti ga nkanyama, su yomberi hakaweri muhumba, yomberi kafiruwa kagululi nguwu zakuyi. Muntu ayu hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. Wankanyama awa hawaweri wakalaliru kwa mwenga.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />Viumbi avi haviweri vikalaliru kwa mwenga. Likwili na mbewa na kila ntambu ya shitunu, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />guruguru na magondu na shigologozi na goromwe na nalwivu. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Wakanyama woseri awa wawera nkalaliru kwa mwenga na muntu yoseri yakashinkula mawuti gawu, su hawakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Payiwera mawuti ga wankanyama awa gatulukilira shintu shoseri, shintu sha mbawu ama nguwu ama likuli ama lilobota ama shombu shoseri shashitenderwa kwa ntambu yoseri ilii, shombu ashi hashiweri shihumba mpaka pamihi. Su kushitenda shiweri shiherepa shifiruwa shigululuwi kwa mashi. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Payiwera mawuti ga nkanyama gatulukira shiwiga, su shoseri shashiwera mushombu ashi hasiweri shihumba na shombu ashi hashipandwi. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Handa mashi ga mushiwiga shilii gatulukira mushiboga shoseri, shiboga hashiweri shihumba. Na shilandu shashiwera mushiwiga ashi hashiweri shihumba. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Kila shintu shashiguwililwa na mizoga yoseri ya nkanyama, hashiweri shihumba. Paliwera litanuri lya kubanikira mabumunda ama shifinja sha kutelekera, vifiruwa vipandwi. Vyoseri avi haviweri vihumba, na vyeni viwera nkalaliru kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Pamuhera na hangu, linegu lya mashi ama mbwiru za mashi haviweri viherepa. Kumbiti shoseri shashishinkula mizoga ya wankanyama yayitulukila mumashi aga, hashiweri shihumba. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Payiwera seemu ya mizoga ya wankanyama awa payitulukira mbeyu za kuyala, mbeyu azi hapeni ziweri zihumba. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Kumbiti mbeyu azi pazitulitwi mumashi zimeri na seemu ya mizoga ya wankanyama awa itulukiwa na mbeyu azi, su mbeyu azi haziweri nkalaliru kwa mwenga, mbeyu azi ziyasilwi kutali.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />Payiwera nkanyama yoseri yakalekeziwitwi mumliyi pakafuwa mweni, muntu yoseri pakashinkula mzoga gwakuyi, su hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Muntu yoseri pakaliya seemu ya vinofu vya nkanyama ayu, hakagululi nguwu zakuyi na hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. Na muntu yoseri yakapapa mzoga gwa nkayama ayu, hakagululi nguwu zakuyi na hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />Shiwumbi shoseri shashikwawakwawa pasipanu hashiweri shikalaliru kwa mwenga, namushiliya nakamu. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Shiwumbi shoseri shashigendagenda kwa mtima gwakuyi, shoseri shashigendagenda kwa magulu gakuyi gamsheshi ama nyayu zivuwa, ama shoseri shashilikwawakwawa, namushiliya toziya shiwera shikalaliru kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Su namulitenda wahumba maweni kwa kuliya viwumbi vyavikwawakwawa toziya viwera nkalaliru kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, mulityeki na muweri wananagala toziya neni wera mnanagala. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu yanuwalaviya mwenga kulawa muisi ya Misri neni weri Mlungu gwenu, su muweri wananagala toziya neni wera mnanagala.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />Malagaliru aga gawusu wankanyama na wampongu na kila shiwumbi shashilikala mumashi na kila shiwumbi shashigendagenda palitapaka. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Mwenga mfiruwa kulola weri shilii shashiwera shihumba na shilii shashiherepa, shiwumbi shilii shamuweza kushiliya na shiwumbi shilii shamuweza ndiri kuliya.<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Kupungwa kwa wadala pa kwiwula mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu, mdala pakawera na yinda, na pakiwula mwana mpalu, yomberi hakaweri muhumba kwamashaka saba kulinganira na mashaka gakuyi yagawera kwa wadala. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Mwana yakiwukiti hakingiziwi jandu mulishaka lya nane pakwiwuka kwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Shakapanu mdala ayu hakendereyi kuwera muhumba kwa mashaka selasini na tatu kulawirana na kulawa mwazi kwakuyi. Shaka ashi, nakashinkula shintu shoseri shashityekitwi ama kwingira pahala pananagala ama pahala kuguwira mpaka mashaka ga kupungwa kwakuyi pagapera.<verse eid="LEV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Kumbiti mdala ayu pakiwula mwana mdala, yomberi hakaweri muhumba kwa majuma mawili ntambu yayiweriti mumashaka gakuyi ga shidala. Hakendereyi kuwera muhumba kwa mashaka sitini na sita kulawirana na kulawa mwazi kwakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />Mashaka ga kupungwa kwakuyi pagapera kwajili ya mwana mpalu ama mdala, yomberi hakamjegeri mtambika pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, mwana gwa kondolu gwa shinja shimu toziya ya tambiku ya kulunguziya pamuhera na mpongu nkunda ama teteli, kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Mtambika hakamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku na kumkolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Su mdala ayu hakapungwi kulawirana na mwazi gwakuyi. Aga ndo malagaliru kwa mdala yoseri yakiwula mwana mpalu ama mdala.<verse eid="LEV 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />Handa mdala ayu pakasinda kulaviya mwana gwa kondolu, su hakajegi teteli wawili ama wana wawili wa nkunda, nkunda yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziya na yumonga kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. Mtambika hakamkolaniziyi mawoku mdala ayu kulongolu kwa Mlungu, su yomberi hakapungwi.<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Malweri ga panshimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />Muntu pakawera na uvimbi ama upeli ama shibaku shifufu mushimba yakuyi, shakapanu shilanguziya kuwera ungumbura, su yomberi hakajegwi kwa mtambika Aruni ama kwa yumu gwa wana wakuyi yakawera mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Su mtambika hakapaloli weri pahala papawera na ulweli na paiwera nvili za pahala palii zigalambuka na kuwera mfufu na ulweli weni pauwoneka kuwera wamgati ng'anji mushimba yakuyi, su ulweli awu hauweri ungumbura. Mtambika pakamalira kumlola weri, yomberi hakabweri kuwera muntu ayu kawera muhumba. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Kumbiti paiwera upeli awu, tembera shiwera shifufu kumbiti shingira ndiri ng'anji munshima ama nvili za pahala palii zigalambuka ndiri kuwera mfufu, su mtambika hakamtuli gweka muntu ulii ka mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Mulishaka lya saba, mtambika hakamloliloli kayi muntu ulii, su kulawirana na kulolalola weri kwa mtambika, payiwoneka ulweli ulii weneya ndiri munshimba ya muntu ulii, mtambika hakamtuli gweka muntu ulii kwa mashaka gamonga saba.<verse eid="LEV 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Mulishaka lya saba, mtambika hakamloliloli kayi muntu ulii. Upele ulii pawufifiya na kweneya ndiri munshimba, mtambika hakabweri kuwera muntu ulii kapungwa, ulweli ulii uweriti upeli hera. Muntu ulii hakagululi nguwu zakuyi na hakaweri muherepa kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Kumbiti upeli awu pawuweneya munshimba yakuyi pakulilanguziya mweni kwa mtambika kwajili ya kupungwa kwakuyi, su hakizi kayi kwa mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Mtambika hakaloliloli weri muntu ulii payiwera upeli weneya munshimba, mtambika hakabweri kuwera muntu ulii kawera muhumba, toziya ulweli ulii uwera ungumbula.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />Handa muntu pakawera na ulweli yaulifana na ungumbula, yomberi hakajegwi kwa mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Mtambika hamkaloliloli weri na yomberi pakawera na uvimbi mfufu yautenda nvili vyakuyi ziweri mfufu na uvimbi awu ugalambuka na kuwera shilonda, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />ulweli awu uwera ungumbula wa shaka shivuwa. Mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera muhumba. Mtambika hapeni kamtuli gweka kayi muntu ayu mukulolalola toziya kawera kala muhumba.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />Payiwera ungumbula awu umpata na kweneya munshimba yoseri, kwanjira mumtuwi mpaka mumagulu ntambu yakawona mtambika, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />su mtambika hakamloliloli weri, handa ulweli yaulifana na ungumbula paweneya munshimba yoseri, su mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera kaherepa. Toziya nshimba igalambuka kuwera mfufu na muntu ayu kawera muherepa. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Kumbiti pashiwoneka shilonda munshimba mwa muntu ulii, muntu ulii hakaweri muhumba. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Mtambika hakashiloliloli weri shilonda shilii na kumbwera kuwera muntu ulii kawera muhumba toziya ulweli awu uwera ungumbula. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Kumbiti shilonda ashi pashigalambuka kayi na kuwera shifufu, muntu ayu hakawuyi kwa mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Mtambika hakamloliloli weri kayi na pakawona kuwera shigalambuka na kuwera shifufu, su hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera kaherepa.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />Handa muntu pakawera na liputi munshimba mwakuyi na kapona, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />na pahala papaweriti na liputi lilii pawera na uvimbi mfufu, ama kuwera pasheri kidogu na pafufu kidogu, muntu ayu kafiruwa kamlanguziyi mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Mtambika hakamloliloli weri muntu ulii. Mtambika pakawona nshimba iwera na shilindi na nvili za pahala palii pagalambuka kuwera pafufu, su mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera muhumba, toziya ulweli ulii uwera ungumbura yaulawirana na liputi. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Kumbiti mtambika pakamlola weri muntu ulii na kuwona kuwera nvili za pahala palii ziwera mfufu ndiri ama kwahera shilindi, pahala palii pafifiya hera, su mtambika hakamtuli gweka muntu ulii kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Handa ulweli awu hauweneyi munshimba, su mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera muhumba na hakamtuli gweka toziya seemu ilii pawera na ulweli. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Kumbiti payiwera seemu ilii yeneya ndiri ulweli, su lilii liwera likovu lya liputi hera. Mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera kaherepa.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />Payiwera nshimba ya muntu kwana pahala palungulira na pahala papalunguliriti pagalambuka kuwera pasheri pafufu ama ndo pafufu, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />mtambika hakapaloliloli weri. Handa pakawona kuwera nvili zigalambuka kuwera mfufu na pahala palii pawera na shilindi, ulweli awu hauweri ungumbula. Ungumbula awu ulawira kulawirana na kulungulira. Mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera muhumba, toziya kawera na ulweli wa ungumbula. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Kumbiti mtambika pakawona kuwera nvili za pahala palii mfufu ndiri na kwahera shilindi kumbiti pafifiya hera, mtambika hakamtuli gweka muntu ulii kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Mulishaka lya saba, mtambika hakamloli kayi. Ulweli ulii pawuweneya munshimba, mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera muhumba, toziya ulweli awu uwera ungumbula. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Shipaku shilii pashyeneya ndiri kumbiti shififiya hera, uvimbi ulii ulawirana na kuungulira hera, su mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera kaherepa toziya ashi shiwera shipaku hera sha kulungulira.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />Handa mpalu ama mdala pakawera na uvimbi pamtuwi ama mushidevu, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />mtambika hakauloli weri ulweli awu. Mtambika pakawona kuwera kwana shilindi na nvili za pahala palii ziwera njanu na nyembamba, su mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera muhumba, toziya upele ulii uwera ungumbula wa mumtuwi ama mushidevu. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Kumbiti mtambika pakawona kuwera kahera shilindi na nvili ziwera ntitu ndiri, su mtambika hakatuli gweka muntu ulii kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Mulishaka lya saba, mtambika hakashiloli shilonda shilii. Payiwera shilonda shilii shyeneya ndiri munshimba na kwahera nvili za njanu ama kwahera upeli woseri pahala palii, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />su muntu hakamogwi nvili ama ndevu shakuwi. Kumbiti palii papawera na upeli hapeni kapamogi. Su mtambika hakamtuli gweka kwa shaka shamonga sha mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Mulishaka lya saba, mtambika hakauloli upeli ulii. Mtambika pakawona kuwera upeli ulii weneya ndiri munshimba ama wingira ndiri mngati munshimba mwakuyi, su mtambika hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera kaherepa. Muntu ulii hakagululi nguwu zakuyi na yomberi hakaweri muherepa. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Kumbiti upeli awu pauweneya pakupungwa, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />mtambika kafiruwa kamloliloli weri muntu ulii na payiwera upeli ulii weneya munshimba, mtambika hapeni kasakuli nvili za njanu, muntu ulii hakaweri muhumba. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Kumbiti mtambika pakawona kuwera upeli ulii upona na nvili ntitu zikula pahala palii, su vironda virii vipona, muntu ayu hakaweri kaherepa. Mtambika hakambweri muntu ayu kuwera kaherepa.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />Handa muntu yoseri mpalu ama mdala, pakawera na shipaku shifufu munshimba mwakuyi, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />mtambika hakamloli weri muntu ayu. Mtambika pakawona kuwera vipaku avi viwera vifufu kididini, awu hawuweri upeli wa ntambu hera, su muntu ayu hakaweri kaherepa.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />Handa mpalu kawera na shipara, yomberi kawera kaherepa. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Handa mpalu ayu pakawera na shipara kwanjira kumbeli mushisogu mpaka kulongolu pashiwunji, muntu ayu kawera kaherepa. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Kumbiti pamtuwi mushipara kuwera na shipaku shisheri shifufu, ulweli awu hauweri ungumbula yawulawira mushipala shakuyi mumtuwi ama kushiwunji kwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Mtambika hakamloli weri muntu ulii. Su mtambika pakawona kuwera uvimbi uwera msheri mfufu pashipara shakuyi ama kushiwunji shakuyi na pawoneka gambira ungumbula munshimba yakuyi, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />su muntu ayu kawera na ungumbula, yomberi kawera muhumba. Mtambika hakambweri muntu ayu kuwera muhumba. Ulweli wakuyi wapamtuwi pakuwi.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />Muntu yoseri yakawera na ungumbula, yomberi hakavali nguwu zyazidegeka na seemu ya mlomu gwakuyi gwa pampindi hakagubiki na kubotanga kwa liziwu likulu pakalonga, neni muhumba, neni muhumba. <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Yomberi hakendereyi kuwera muhumba kwa shaka shoseri pakawera na ulweli awu. Yomberi kawera muhumba, su hakalikali gweka yakuyi kunja kulugonjeru.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga uvukuma munguwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />Handa kwana ntambu yoseri ya uvukuma munguwu, payiwera nguwu ya sufu ama nguwu mfufu iherepa, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />payiwera nguwu ayi ipotuwa kwa nguwu mfufu iherepa ama kwa sufu ama nguwu ya likuli ya ntambu yoseri ilii, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />payiwera uvukuma awu uwera na langi ya mahamba mawisi ama langi nsheri munguwu ayi, nguwu ayi iwera na uvukuma. Su nguwu ayi ifiruwa kalanguziwi mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Mtambika hakawuloli weri uvukuma awu na kuyitula nguwu ayi gweka kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Mulishaka lya saba, mtambika hakawuloli uvukuma awu. Payiwera uvukuma ulii weneya munguwu ilii, nguwu ilii iwera na uvukuma. Su nguwu ulii hayiweri humba. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Mtambika hakayipambiri motu nguwu ilii toziya iwera na ntambu zoseri za uvukuma.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />Kumbiti mtambika pakawona kuwera uvukuma ulii weneya ndiri munguwu ilii, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />su mtambika hakalagaliri nguwu ilii igululwi na kutulwa gweka kwa mashaka gamonga saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Mtambika hakayiloli nguwu ayi pakugululwa. Payiwera alama ilii ingalambuka ndiri langi yakuyi tembera uvukuma weneya ndiri, nguwu ayi iwera humba. Nguwu ayi hayipambwi mumotu, pashiwera shipaku sha uvukuma shiwera kumbeli ama kulongolu kwa nguwu ayi.<verse eid="LEV 13:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Handa mtambika pakawona kuwera shipaku shilii shififiya pakugululwa, su hakayidegi seemu ilii yayiwera na ntambu ya uvukuma. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Shakapanu shipaku shilii pashiwoneka kayi munguwu yayisonitwi ama yayipotitwi ama mushintu shoseri sha likuli, uvukuma awu weneya. Su nguwu ayi Hayipambilwi mumotu. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Kumbiti nguwu yayilawilwa na uvukuma pakugululwa, su ifiruwa igululwi kayi iherepi.<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Aga ndo malagaliru yagawusu ntambu ya uvukuma yawulawira, ntambu yawulawira munguwu ya sufu ama nguwu ya nfufu ama nguwu yayipotitwi ama nguwu ya likuli. Kwa njira ayi mwenga hamuwezi kuvimana nguwu humba na nguwu iherepa.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Kupungwa pa kulwala malweli yagalifana na ungumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />Aga ndo malagaliru ga muntu yakawera na malweli yagawera panshimba mulishaka lya kupungwa kwakuyi. Pakupona yomberi hakajegwi kwa mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />Mtambika hakagendi kumlola muntu ulii kunja kukambi. Handa payiwera ungumbula ulii upona, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />Su mtambika hakalagaliri wantu wajegi wampongu wawili waherepa yawawera wakomu, viraa wajegi shipandi sha mtera gwa mwerezi na sufu nsheri na lutambi lwa mtera gwa hisopu kwajili ya muntu ulii yakagenda kupungwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Mtambika hakalagaliri wamlikituli mpongu yumu mushiwiga shimu sha mashi ga mbwiru. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Shakapanu mtambika hakamtoli mpongu ulii yumonga yakawera mkomu pamuhera na shipandi sha mtera gwa mwerezi na sufu nsheri na lutambi lulii lwa mtera gwa hisopu na kuvijwika vyoseri mumwazi gwa mpongu ulii yakalikitulitwi. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Su hakamumishiri mwazi muntu ulii yakapungitwi mala saba, shakapanu hakambweri muntu ulii kuwera kaherepa. Mpongu mkomu ulii hakamleki kagendi zakuyi kumalambu kunja kulushi.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Muntu ulii hakazigululi nguwu zakuyi na hakamogi vili zakuyi na kwoga mashi, su yomberi hakaweri muherepa. Pa aga goseri muntu ulii hakawuyi mukambi, kumbiti hakalikali kunja kuliringu lyakuyi kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Mulishaka lya saba, yomberi hakamogi kayi vili zakuyi zoseri pamuhera na ndevu na nkope za masu gakuyi. Shakapanu hakagululi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga mashi, su yomberi hakaweri kaherepa.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />Mulishaka lya nani, yomberi hakajegi wana wa kondolu washipalu wawili yawahera na shidoda shoseri, kilu ntatu za ubumu unama yawuhanganyikitwi na lipaki shikombi shimu shididini kuwera tambiku. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Mtambika yakamubwera muntu ayu kuwera kaherepa hakamjegi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala pamuhera na vintu vyakavijegiti.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Mtambika hakamtoli mwana gwa kondolu gwa shipalu yumu na kumlavilira tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda pamuhera na lipaki lyaliwera pakwegera kumema lita yimu. Su yomberi hakavinyasuli kumpindi kulanguziya kuwera vya neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Shakapanu hakamlikituli mwana gwa kondolu pahala pananagala, pahala pawalikitulwa wankanyama wa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na tambiku ya kulunguziya. Tambiku ayi ya kuwusiya makosa, ntambu yayiwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, tambiku ayi hayiweri ya mtambika, hayiweri tambiku nanagala nentu. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Mtambika hakatoli seemu ya mwazi gwa kanyama gwa tambiku gwa kuwusiya makosa na kumswaga muukingu wa pasi wa likutu lwakuyi lya kumliwu na shyala shikulu sha liwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu na shyala shikulu sha ligulu lyakuyi lya kumliwu. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Shakapanu mtambika hakatoli shikombi shimu shididini sha lipaki na kulitula mushiganja sha liwoku lyakuyi lya kumshigi. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Yomberi hakajwiki shyala shakuyi sha liwoku lya kumliwu mulipaki lilii na kumumishira muntu ulii yakapungwa mala saba kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Lipaki lyalisigala mushiganja sha liwoku lyakuyi, hakamswagi muntu ayu yakagenda kupungwa mukingu ya likutu lya kumliwu na shyala shikulu sha liwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu na shyala shikulu sha ligulu lyakuyi lya kumliwu, pahala palaa palii papalaviwa mwazi gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya makosa. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Lipaki lyalisigala hakamswagi muntu ulii pamtuwi. Su mtambika hakamlaviliri tambiku ya kumkolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />Shakapanu mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na kumtenda muntu ayu yakapungwa tambiku ya kumkolaniziya mawoku su kumuwusilira uhumba wakuyi. Shakapanu hakamlikituli mwana gwa kondolu gwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa.<verse eid="LEV 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />Mtambika hakalaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziya na tambiku ya viboga pashitalawanda. Su mtambika hakamlaviliri muntu ayu tambiku ya kumkolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi hakalekeziwi kuwera pamuhera na wayaguwi.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />Kumbiti payiwera muntu ayu kawera muhushu, kahera uwezu wa kulaviya vintu avi, su yomberi hakajegi mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu kaweri tambiku ya kuwusiya makosa, mtambika hakavinyasuli kumpindi kulanguziya viwera vya neni Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya kumkolaniziya mawoku. Yomberi hakajegi viraa kilu yimu ya ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi na lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga na lipaki shikombi shimu shididini. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Viraa hakajegi wankunda wawili ama wana wa teteri wawili, yumu hakaweri kwajili ya kuwusiya vidoda na yumonga hakaweri kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Mulishaka lya nani, muntu ulii hakamjegeri mtambika vintu virii kulongolu kwa ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala kwajili ya kupungwa kwakuyi kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Mtambika hakamtoli mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya likosa pamuhera na lipaki shikombi shimu shididini na kuvinyasula kumpindi kulanguziya viwera vya neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Mtambika hakamlikituli kondolu gwashipalu ulii gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya makosa. Shakapanu hakatoli seemu ya mwazi na kumswaga muntu ulii yakagenda kupungwa muukingu wa pasi wa likutu lyakuyi lya kumliwu na mushyala shikulu shakuyi sha liwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu na mushyala shikulu shakuyi sha lugulu lyakuyi lya kumliwu. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Shakapanu mtambika hakamiminiri lipaki kidogu mushiganja sha liwoku lyakuyi lya kumshigi. <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />Su mtambika hakamumishiri muntu ulii kwa shyala shakuyi sha kumliwu, shyasi shana lipaki lyaliwera mushiganja shakuyi sha kumshigi mala saba kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Mtambika hakamswagi lipaki muntu ulii yakapungitwi muukingu wa likutu lyakuyi lya kumliwu na mushyala shikulu shakuyi sha liwoku lya kumliwu na mushyala shikulu sha ligulu lyakuyi lya kumliwu. Hakamswagi pahala palii pakamswagiti mwazi gulii gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya makosa. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Lipaki lyalisigaliti mumawoku mwakuyi hakamswagi mumtu ulii pamtuwi pakuyi, su kumlavilira tambiku ya kumkolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Shakapanu mtambika hakamtoli yumu gwa wankunda walii ama wateteri wawili shiyasi sha muntu ulii ntambu yakaweziti kujega. <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Nkunda yumu hakaweri kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na yumonga hakaweri kwajili ya kulunguziya. Pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga, mtambika hakamlaviliri tambiku ya kumkolaniziya mawoku kwajili ya ulii yakapungwiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Aga ndo malagaliru ga muntu yakawera na ungumbula yakaweza ndiri kulaviya tambiku zilii zyazifiruwa mukupunga.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvukuma yawuwera mnumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />Pamwingira muisi ya Kanaani yang'enda kuwapanani kuwera ya mwenga, neni hantuli ntambu ya uvukuma umeli mngati mwa numba za aku muisi yamgenda kuwera ya mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />Su yakawera na numba ayi kafiruwa kamgambiri mtambika ntambu ya ungumbula uwoneka mnumba mwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Mtambika hakalagaliri vintu vyoseri mngati mwa numba ayi vilaviwi pamberi pa yomberi hakeniyanji kulolalola ulweri, naviza vyoseri kubweruwa kuwera humba. Shakapanu mtambika hakingiri kuilola numba ayi. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Hakaloliloli uvukuma awu, handa uvukuma awu uwoneka mushibambaza na ujega madowa ga langi ya kijani ama nsheri na kuwoneka kuwera gapena mngati mwa shibambaza, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />su mtambika hakalawi kunja kuligomi na kuyitata numba ayi kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Lishaka lya saba mtambika hakawuyi na kuilola kayi numba ayi. Payiwera uvukuma awu weneya mushibambaza sha numba ayi, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />mtambika hakawagambiri mabuwi yagawera seemu ya uvukuma gawusiwi na kwaswa pahala humba kunja kwa kung'onjeru. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Lityasiwu lya numba ayi halimapulwi na galii yagamapulitwi hagayasilwi pahala humba kunja kung'onjeru. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Shakapanu hawatoli mabuwi gasyayi na kunyawa pahala pawamapuliti na womberi hawatyasiwu kayi.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />Payiwera uvukuma awu ulawira kayi munumba ayi pawalaviyiti kala mabuwi aga na kukwalambula mhanga gwa sementi na kutyeremeka kayi mhanga gwa sementi, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />su mtambika kizi kuyilolalola. Payiwera uvukuma weneya mnumba ayi, ama uvukuma wa kuhalabisiya numba, numba ayi ndo humba. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Numba ayi ndo mpaka wayibomoli na mabuwi gakuyi, mitera yakuyi na lityasiwu na litapaka lyakuyi vijeguwi pahala humba kunja kwa lushi.<verse eid="LEV 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Muntu yoseri yakingira mngati mwa numba hayi shaka shoseri ashi shayitatitwi, hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Yoseri yakagonja mnumba ayi ama hakaliyi shiboga mnumba amu, mpaka kazigululi nguwu zakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />Kumbiti pakingira kala mnumba ayi, mtambika pakawona kuwera uvukuma haweneneyi mnumba pakutyasiwa, su mtambika hakabweri kuwera numba ayi ndo iherepa toziya uvukuma upera. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Su kuyipungi numba ayi, yakawera na numba hakajegi wampongu wawili pamuhera na shipandi sha mwelezi, sufu nsheri na lutambi lya hisopu. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Mtambika hakamlikituli yumu gwa mpongu mushiwiga shashiwera na mashi ga mbwiru. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Hakatoli shipandi sha mwelezi, lutambi lwa hisopu na ubunda wa mibahira ya kondolu msheri pamuhera na mpongu yumonga yakawera mkomu na kuvilekera vyoseri mumwazi gwa mpongu ulii yakalikitulitwi pashiwiga sha mashi ga mbwiru na hakayimishili numba ayi mwazi mala saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Hangu ndo ntambu hakayipungi numba ayi kwa mwazi gwa mpongu na mashi gaherepa ga mbwiru na mpongu mkomu na shipandi sha mwelezi lutambi lwa hisopu na sufu nsheri ilii. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Mpongu mkomu ulii hakamleki kagendi zakuyi kumalambu kunja kulung'onjeru. Hangu ndo ntambu hakayipungi numba ayi, su yeni hayiherepi.<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Aga gawera malagaliru kuusu ntambu zoseri za upeli, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />uvukuma mnguwu ama mnumba <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />uvimbi ama liputi ama shipaku shifufu, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />su kulanguziya shintu shashiwera humba na shashiwera ndiri humba. Ali ndo lilagaliru kuusu ntambu ya uvukuma.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Vintu vivyamtenda muntu nakajimiluwa mukuguwira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Haruni, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />guwagambiri Waisraeli hangu. Mpalu yoseri pawumlawa ufira, ufira awu umtenda kaweri humba, <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />na aga ndo malagaliru ga humba. Shipindi shoseri pawumlawa ufira ama ufira pawuwera udiwilwa mngati mwakuyi, muntu ayu ndo humba. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Shitanda shoseri shakagonjera ama shakakalira, hashiweru humba, <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Muntu yoseri hanakashinguli shitanda shakuyi muntu ayu ndo mpaka kaputi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Muntu yoseri yakakalira shintu shoseri shakakaliriti muntu ayu yawumlawiti ufira, ndo mpaka kaputi nguwu na kwoga, na hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Muntu yoseri yakamshinkula muntu yawumlawa ufira, mpaka kaputi nguwu yakuyi na kwogi, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Muntu yoseri yakamtemera mata na muntu yawumlawa ufira ndo mpaka muntu ayu yawamtemeliti mata kaputi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Shoseri shakukalira sha nkanyama shakakaliriti muntu ayu yawumlawa ufira hashiweri humba. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Muntu yoseri yakashinkula shintu shoseri shakakaliriti muntu ayu, hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. Muntu yoseri yakapapa shintu shoseri shashiweriti sha muntu ayu ndo mpaka kaputi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Muntu yoseri yawumlawa ufira pakamshingula muntu pota kugulula huti mawoku gakuyi na kwoga, yakashingulitwi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Shombu shoseri sha litapaka shashishingulitwi na muntu ayu yawumlawa ufira ndo mpaka shipandwi. Kumbiti shombu shoseri sha mbawu ndo mpaka shigululwi kwa mashi.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />Mpalu yoseri yawumlawa ufira pakaponiziwa ulweri wakuyi, ndo mpaka muntu ayu kaheperi mashaka saba pamberi pa kuwusiwa uhumba wakuyi. Hakaputi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga mashi yaganyilirika, yomberi hakaweri kaherepa.<verse eid="LEV 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Lishaka lya nane, ndo mpaka kajegi ngunda wawili ama wana wawili wa ngunda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pamlyangu gwa liringu lya kuliwona na kumpanana mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Mtambika hakawalaviyi awa, yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na gwingi kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa na mtambika hakamtenderi muntu ayu maluwa ga kukolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kumwusilira uhumba wakuyi wa kumlawa ufira.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />Handa mpalu yoseri pakalota, ndo mpaka kogi mashi nshimba yoseri, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Nguwu yoseri yaitulukilitwi na ulenji ama likuli lyoseri lyalishinkulitwi na ulenji ayi ndo mpaka igululwi kwa mashi na haviweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Handa mpalu pakagonja na mdala, umlawa ulenji, su mpaka woseri wawili wogi mashi na womberi hawaweri wahumba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />Mdala yoseri yakawera mumashaka gakuyi, hakaweri humba kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba. Muntu yoseri yakamshinkula mdala ayu hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Shintu shoseri shakagonjera ama kulivagira shaka shakuyi sha kusuma mwazi, hashiweri humba. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Muntu yoseri yakashishinkula shitanda shakuyi mdala ayu ndo mpaka kaputi nguwu zakuyi na kuyoga kwa mashi, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Muntu yoseri yakakishikula shoseri sheni mdala ayu kashikalira hakaziputi nguwu zakuyi na kuyoga mashi, na yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Muntu yoseri hayanakashinkuli shintu shoseri shakagonjiriti ama kutamira mdala ayu, hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Handa mpalu pakagonja na mdala ayu na mwazi gwa mdala ayu gumtulukira mpalu ayu, su mpalu ayu hakaweri humba kwa mashaka saba. Lisaga lyoseri lyakagonjera mpalu ayu haliweri humba.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />Handa mdala pagumlawa mwazi kwa mashaka gavuwa kuliku ntambu yayiwera ama gumlawa mwazi shipindi shakuyi ndiri sha kulawa mwazi, su hakendereyi kuwera humba shaka shoseri mwaza pagulawa Ayiweri handa yayiweriti mashaka gakuyi ga mwezi. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Shitamda shoseri shakagonjera shaka ashi ama shibanta shoseri shakatamira, hashiweri humba teratera handa shipindi sha uhumba wakuyi wa kumlawa mwazi. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Muntu yoseri yakavishinkula vintu vilii, hakaweri humba na ndo mpaka kaputi nguwu zakuyi na kuyoga, yomberi hakaweri humba mpaka pamihi.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Pakuyuma mwazi gwakuyi mdala ayu hakahepi mpaka mashaka saba su kaweri herepa na pamashaka aga hakaweri herepa. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Lishaka lya nani hakatoli ngunda wawili ama wana wadidika wawili wa ngunda na kumjegera mtambika pakwegera na kumlyangu gwa liringu lya kuliwona. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Mtambika hakalaviyi yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na yumonga kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa. Kwa njira ayi mtambika hakamtenderi mdala ayu maluwa ga kukolaniziya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kumwusilira uhumba wa kumlawa mwazi.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />Ndo hangu ntambu hamuwaberiziyi Waisraeli na uhumba awu, nawiza kwigiranga numba yangu nanagala yayiwera muwamu mwawu wingira amu na uhumba wawu, pawatenda hangu hawalagwi.<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Ali ndo lagiru kuusu mpalu yawumlawa ufira na yawumlawa ulenji na kuwera humba, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />Lagiru ali limhusu viraa mdala yagumlawa mwazi na kuwera humba. Lagiru ali limhusu mpalu ama mdala yoseri yashimlawa shoseri na viraa limhusu yakagonja na mdala yakawera ndo mhumba.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Lishaka lya ukolaniziwu mawoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kayoweriti na Musa pa wana wawili wa Aruni kuhowa shaka shilii pawamsegeleriti Mtuwa Mlungu na kumlavilira ubani yaufiruwa ndiri. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, “Gumberiziyi mlongu gwaku Aruni, nakingira Pahala Pananagala Nentu kumbeli kwa lipaziya, kulongolu kwa mfiniku gwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu yagushemuwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda shaka shashijimiluwa ndiri, pakajimira ndiri hakahowi toziya handawiri muliwundi pamfuniku yagushemuwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda.<verse eid="LEV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Pamberi pa kwingira Aruni Pahala Pananagala Nentu hakalaviyi mwana gwa ng'ombi kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda pakuwera na kondolu gwashipalu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa.”<verse eid="LEV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Pamberi pa kwingira Pahala Pananagala Nentu, yomberi hakogi mashi, shakapanu hakavali nguwu za utambika. Hakavali kaputura nguwu mfufu, viraa hakavali lihabiti lya nguwu mfufu na kulitawa lufunga lwa nguwu mfufu mushunu. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Hakatoli mbuzi pongu wawili kulawa mushipinga sha wantu wa Israeli kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na kondolu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Aruni hakamlaviyi ng'ombi kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda kwajili yakuyi mweni na kwajili ya kaya yakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Shakapanu hakatoli mbuzi pongu wawili walii na kuwatula pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Hakawagalambuziyi simbi mbuzi pongu wawili walii, simbi yimu kwajili ya kundavilira tambiku neni Mtuwa Mlungu na tambiku imonga kwajili ya mbuzi ulii yumonga yakalaviwa kunja kwa kulugonjeru yakashemwa Azazeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Aruni hakamjegi mbuzi gwashipalu ulii yakaweriti kwajili ya kundavilira tambiku neni Mtuwa Mlungu na kundavilira tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Kumbiti mbuzi pongu ulii yakashemwa Azazeli yakalaviwa kunja kwa kulugonjeru, hakalaviwi kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu pakawera mkomu su kaweri tambiku ya kukolaniziya mawoku, mtambika hakamleki kagendi kushiwala kwa Azazeli, pakapapa vidoda vya wantu.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Aruni hakamlaviyi ng'ombi kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyakuyi mweni pamuhera na kaya yakuyi, su hakamlikituli nkanyama ulii kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Shakapanu hakatoli shetezu na kutola makala ga motu pashitalawanda sha kutambikira kulongou kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kutola ubani yausagitwi weri mawoku mawili. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Su yomberi nakiza kuhowa, hakaujegi ubani awu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kuulekera mumotu su lyosi lya ubani awu ligubikili mfiniku yagushemwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda, Lisandiku lya Lipatanu. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Hakatoli mwazi kidogu gwa nkanyama ulii na kugumishira kwa shyala shakuyi uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mala saba, pamfiniku yagushemuwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda, shakapanu hakagumishili kwa shyala shakuyi mwazi gumonga kulongolu ku Lisanduku lya Lipatanu mala saba.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />Shakapanu hakamlikituli mbuzi gwa shipalu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vya wantu woseri. Mwazi gwa mbuzi ulii hakagujegi Pahala Pananagala Nentu na kutenda ntambu yakatenditi kwa mwazi gulii gwa ng'ombi ulii, yomberi hakagumishili pashibikiru, uwega wa kulongolu kulisanduku lilii. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Kwa kutenda hangu, yomberi hakapapungi Pahala Pananagala Nentu, toziya ya uhumba na makosa na vidoda vyawu vyoseri vya wantu wa Israeli. Ntambu ayi hakatendi viraa kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala lyaliwera pakati pa wantu yawawera wahumba. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Aruni pakagenda Pahala Pananagala Nentu Muliringu Linanagala kupapunga, kwahera ulekeziwu kwa muntu yoseri ulii kwingira pahala poseri palii Muliringu Linanagala, wantu hawalekeziwi kwingira Aruni pakamalira kala na kulawa kunja.<verse eid="LEV 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Shakapanu Aruni hakalawi na kugenda pashitalawanda sha kutambikira shashiwera kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kupapunga. Hakatoli mwazi kidogu gwa ng'ombi ulii na gwa mbuzi ulii na kugatyemeleka magoli ga shitalawanda sha kutambikira wega zoseri. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Shakapanu hakajwiki shyala shakuyi mumwazi gulii na kugumishira pashitalawanda sha kutambikira mala saba kushityeka na kupunga uhumba woseri wa wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuzi yakajegwa kushiwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Pa Aruni kumalira kupapunga Pahala Pananagala Nentu, Muliringu Linanagala pamuhera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira, su yomberi hakamjegi mbuzi pongu ulii yakajegwa kunja kulugonjeru pakapapa vidoda vya wantu. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Aruni hakatuli mawoku gakuyi mawili pamtuwi gwa mbuzi ulii yakawera mkomu na kuvitakula vidoda vyoseri vya wantu wa Israeli. Kwa kutenda hangu hakavituli vidoda vyoseri vya wantu wa Israeli pamtuwi gwa mbuzi. Shakapanu hakamsyaguli muntu kamtoli mbuzi ulii kagendi kushiwala pakajegwa na muntu yakalilaviyiti mweni kutenda hangu. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Yomberi hakamleki mbuzi pongu ulii kagendi kushiwala, pahala papawera ndiri na wantu, pakavitola vidoda vyawu vyoseri.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />Shakapanu Aruni hakawuyi Muliringu Linanagala, yomberi hakavuli nguwu zakazivaliti pakingiriti Pahala Pananagala Nentu na kuzileka mlaa. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Su hakogi mashi mu Pahala Pananagala na kuzivala nguwu zakuyi. Hakalawi kunja na kulaviya tambiku kwajili yakuyi mweni na kulaviya tambiku ya kulunguziwa kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli, su kulikolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kwajili yakuyi mweni na wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Lipaki lya nkanyama gwa tambiku gwa kuwusiya vidoda hakalilunguziyi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Muntu ulii yakamjegiti mbuzi ulii yakatoliti vidoda vya wantu, pakawuya kwanja hakazigululi nguwu zakuyi na koga mashi, shakapanu hakawezi kwingira mukambi. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Ng'ombi ulii na mbuzi yawalaviyitwi tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, mwazi gwawu gujegitwi Pahala Pananagala Nentu su kulaviwa tambiku ya kukolaniziya mawoku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, likuli lyawu na vinofu pamuhera na mavi gawu, vyoseri avi havijegwi kulunguziwa kunja kulugonjeru. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Muntu ulii yakavilunguziya, hakaziputi nguwu zakuyi na koga mashi, shakapanu hakawezi kwingira mulugonjeru.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />Lilagaliru ali mfiruwa kuligolokera mashaka goseri. Lishaka lya lilongu lya mwezi gwa saba, maweni mwenga pamuhera na wahenga yawalikala pakati pa mwenga, mfiruwa mwoyi kuliya lishaka ali na kuleka kutenda mahengu. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Mulishaka ali, Aruni hakatendi lihengu lya kuwakolaniziya mawoku, mlekeziwi vidoda vyenu na mwenga hamuweri waherepa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Lishaka ali liwera lishaka lya kwoyera na mwenga hamwoyi kuliya. Lagaliru ali liweran lya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Mtambika yakatyekituwi na kutenda lihengu pa tati gwakuyi, yomberi ndo hakalaviyi tambiku ya kukolaniziya mawoku pakavala nguwu mfufu iherepa nanagala. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />Yomberi hakalaviyi tambiku ya kukolaniziya mawoku Pahala Pananagala Nentu kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala na shitalawanda sha kutambikira na watambika na pamuhera na shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />“Lilagaliru ali liwera lya mashaka goseri, mfiruwa muligolokeri su kulaviya tambiku ya kukolaniziya mawoku kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli mala yimu kwa kila shinja na kulekeziwa vidoda vyawu. Musa katenditi goseri ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu tambiku ya mwazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />gumgambiri Aruni na wana wakuyi na wantu woseri wa Israeli malagaliru aga. <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Handa muntu yoseri pakati pa wantu wa Israeli pakamlikitula ng'ombi ama mwana gwa kondolu ama mbuzi, mulugonjeru ama kunja kulugonjeru kundavilira tambiku, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />badala ya kumjega nkanyama ayu pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala kumlavilira tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, muntu ayu hakaweri na likosa lya kwita mwazi, kita mwazi na hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Nfiru ya lilagalliru ali kuwera wantu wa Israeli badala ya kulaviya tambiku mumalambu, womberi hawalaviyi tambiku kwa kuwajega wankanyama kwa watambika pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, ayi hayiweri tambiku ya ponga. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Su mtambika hakagumishili mwazi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira shashiwera pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagaala na kulilunguziya lipaki lilii liweri ununkira uherepa wa kuherepeziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Wantu wa Israeli hawaleki kulaviya tambiku kwa vinyagu vyawavinyawiti gambira mbuzi, shitwatira sashiwatenda womberi waleki uaminika kwawu weni. Lilagaliru ali liwera lya mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyawu vyoseri.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli kuwera muntu yoseri pakati pa wantu wa Israeli ama muhenga yakalikala pakati pawu yakalaviya tambiku ya kulunguziya ama tambiku yoseri ilii <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />kumbiti kayijega ndiri pakwegera na ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, muntu ayu hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />Handa muntu yoseri gwa shipinga sha Israeli ama muhenga yakalikala pakati pawu pakaliya mwazi goseri gulii, neni hanimlemi muntu ayu yakaliyiti mwazi na hanimtuli gweka kutali kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Hayiweri ntambu ayi toziya ukomu wa shiwumbi uwera mumwazi. Niwalagalira kugulaviya mwazi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira su kuwakolaniziya mawoku na neni kwajili ya makaliru genu maweni, toziya mwazi guwakolaniziya mawoku mumakaliru ga wantu. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Ndo mana niwalagalira wantu wa Israeli ama muhenga yakalikala pakati penu nakaliya mwazi.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />Muntu yoseri gwa Israeli ama muhenga yakalikala pakati penu pakagenda kugomiziya nkanyama ama mpongu, yomberi kafiruwa kiti mwazi gwa shilii shakagomiziyiti na kugugubika mulitapaka. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Toziya makaliru ga shiwumbi gamumwazi. Ndo mana nuwalagalira wantu wa Israeli, nawaliya mwazi gwa shiwumbi shoseri toziya ukomu wa shiwumbi ndo mwazi gwakuyi. Yoseri yakaliya mwazi hakatuluwi gweka.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />Muntu yoseri yakawera mwenikaya ama muhenga, yakaliya shoseri shashifuwiti sheni ama shashilagitwi na nkanyama gwa kuntundu, su kagululi nguwu zakuyi na kogi mashi na hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi, shakapanu hakaweri muherepa. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Kumbiti pakazigulula ndiri nguwu zakuyi na koga mashi, muntu ayu yagamlawira hagaweri gakuyi mweni kwa shilii shakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Matendu madoda ga ndowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Namtenda ntambu yawatenditi wantu wa Misri kwamulikaliti, namtenda ntambu yawatenditi wantu wa Kanaani kwaniwajega. Namtenda ntambu ya matendu gawu. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Mwenga mugajimili malagaliru gangu na mtendi ntambu yaniwalagalira. Neni wera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Handa pagujimira na kugatenda malagaliru gangu, hagwendereyi kulikala mushaka shitali. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu yanikulagira aga gwenga.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu yandagalira malagaliru aga. Muntu yoseri nakagonja na mlongu gwakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Nagumsoniziya tati gwaku kwa kugonja na mawu gwaku yakakwiwuliti. Nagumsoniziya mawu gwaku mweni.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />Nagugonja na mdala yoseri gwa tati gwaku toziya hagumsoniziyi tati gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />Nagugonja na dada gwaku, pamonga dada gwaku gwa kwiwuka ama dada gwaku gwingi.<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />Nagugonja na mzukulu gwaku, mwana gwa mwana gwaku mpalu ama mwana gwa muhinga gwaku, toziya hagulisoniziyi gamweni.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />Nagugonja na muhinga yakiwulitwi na mawu gwaku gwa kambu, toziya yomberi dada gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />Nagugonja na shangazi gwaku, tembera yomberi dada gwa tati gwaku toziya mawu gwawu yumu.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />Nagugonja na dada gwa mawu gwaku, toziya yomberi mawu gwaku mkulu ama mpusu.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Nagugonja na mdala gwa tati gwaku mkulu ama mpusu, toziya yomberi mawu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />Nagugonja na mdala gwa mwana gwaku mpalu, toziya yomberi mikamwana gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />Nagugonja na mdala gwa kaka ama mpusu gwaku, pagutenda hangu hagumsoniziyi kaka ama mpusu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />Nagugonja na muhinga ama mzukulu gwa mdala gwaku. Womberi wawera walongu wakuyi, pagugonja nawu hagutendi vidoda vikulu.<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Nagumyuga dada gwa mdala gwaku, mdala gwaku pakawera kankali mkomu, ntambu ayi hayitendi womberi wasingani.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />Nagugonja na mdala yakawera mukusuma mwazi.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />Nagugonja na mdala gwa wapakwegera gwaku, pagutenda hangu hagulitendi muhumba gamweni.<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />Naguwalaviya wana waku woseri walii kuwera tambiku kwa mlungu Moleki toziya pagutenda hangu hagulihigirangi litawu lyangu neni Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />Nagugonja na mpalu muyagu, shitwatira ashi shiwera shikalaliru.<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />Nagugonja na nkanyama su nagulitula kuwera muhumba. Mdala ama mpalu yoseri nakashitenda shitwatira ashi, pakatenda hakalitendi mweni kuwera muhumba.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />Namulitenda kuwera wahumba maweni toziya ya vitwatira avi, neni niwawinga wantu wa isi yawawera kulongolu kwa mwenga waweriti wahumba. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Womberi watenditi isi yawu iweri humba, su neni niwatoziti kwa vidoda vyawu na isi iwalemiti womberi. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Kumbiti mwenga pamuhera na wahenga yawalikala pakati penu, mfiruwa kugajimira malagaliru na amuli zangu, namtenda vitwatira avi neni Mtuwa Mlungu vyavinkalalira. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Makalaliru aga wagatenditi wantu yawalikaliti muisi ya Kanaani pamberi pa mwenga, womberi wayituliti humba isi. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Su mwenga namtenda vitwatira avi, pamuvitenda vitwatira avi isi hayiwalemi mwenga ntambu yayiwalemiti wantu walii yawalikaliti pamberi pa mwenga.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />Wantu woseri yawafira kutenda vitwatira avi vya kukalaziya, hawatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wawu. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Mugajimili weri goseri ganiwalagalira, namulihumba weni kwa kutenda vitiba vya makalaziwu ntambu yawatenditi wantu yawalikaliti muisi pamberi pa mwenga, namwiza kulitenda wahumba. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu ulii yakalagalira vitwatira avi.<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru gamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />gushigambiri shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli. Mfiruwa muweri wananagala, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu ndo mnanagala. <verse eid="LEV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />Kila yumu gwenu kafiruwa kampanani ligoya mawu gwakuyi na tati gwakuyi na kagajimili mashaka gangu ga Kwoyera. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu ndo yanikulagalira aga gugatendi.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />Namuviguwira vinyagu ama kujinyawira vinyagu vya wamlungu. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu gweka yangu yamfiruwa kunguwira.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />Pamundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambika za ponga, hamundaviliri ntambu yayifiruwa su mpati kujimirwa.<verse eid="LEV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Vinofu vya tambiku ayi viliwi lishaka liraa ali pavilaviwa, viraa mlekeziwa kuiliya na shilawu yakuyi. Shoseri shasisigala mpaka lishaka lya tatu hashilunguziwi motu. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Handa seemu ya vinofu vyakuyi pawaviliya lishaka lya tatu, shitwatira ashi hapeni shiherepiziyi neni, hapeni niyijimili tambiku ayi. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Hanimwazibu muntu yoseri yakaliya tambiku ayi mulishaka lya tatu, toziya yomberi kagalema galii gantakula kuwera gananagala.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />Pagubena mabenu gaku mulirambu, nagumalira kubena viboga vyoseri mumbwega mwa lirambu lyaku ama kuwuya kumbeli kujojonira vyavisigaliti. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Namuwuyira kujojonira kila shintu mulirambu lya mizyabibu, viraa namsola zyabibu zazitulukiti pasi, zyabibu azi haguwalekeri wahushu na wahenga. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu yandagalira vitwatira avi.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />Nagwiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 19:11">nagupayira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 19:11">ama kuligambirana upayira maweni kwa maweni.<verse eid="LEV 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Nagulirapa mpayu kwa litawu lyangu na kulihigilanga litawu lya Mlungu gwenu. Namulyaluwa kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />Nagumzulumu gwa pakwegera gwaku, ama kumwiwira. Shibenamgongu sha muntu yawampanananiti lihengu nashilikala kwaku pashiru poseri mpaka mandawira. <verse eid="LEV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />Nagumtendera lidufiya yakawera na majogu ama kumdiwilira munjira ya muntu yakawera lwisi kumtenda kalikwali. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />Pagutoza gutozi teratera, nagumpendeleya muhushu ama kumtira muntu mkulu, kumbiti gumtozi gwapakwegera gwaku teratera.<verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Nagupalasiya mashongeru ga mpayu kuusu wantu wamonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:16">Nagutakula shoseri sha mpayu mushishyotera motu meshimtendi yomberi kaweri muhatali ya kuhowa. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />Nagumkalalira mlongu gwaku mumoyu mwaku, kumbiti gulikoli mawoku na wapakwegera gwaku su nagwiza kutenda vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />Nagumuwuzilira ama kuwera na shinyongu yumu gwa wantu waku, kumbiti guwafiri wapakwegera waku ntambu yagulifira gamweni. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku yandagalira aga.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />Gugajimili malagaliru gangu. Naguleka wankanyama waku wakwenuwi na wankanya wa ntambu yingi. Mulirambu lyaku naguyala mbeyu ya ntambu mbili. Naguvala nguwu yawapotitwi kwa ntambu mbili za vitambala.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />Mpalu pakagonja na mdala mumanda, ulii yakahetitwa na mpalu yumonga, mdala yakakombolwa ndiri ama kupananwa ulekeziwu, yoseri yakatenda hangu hakazibiwi. Kumbiti nakalaguwa toziya mdala ayu kaweriti ndiri mlekeru. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Mpalu ayu hakajegi pakwegera na Liringu Linanagala tambiku yakuyi ya kondolu gwashipalu kuwusiya makosa na kundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Mtambika hakamkolaniziyi mawoku kwa kumlaviya tambiku kondolu ulii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya vidoda vyakatenditi, su yomberi hakalekeziwi vidoda virii vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />Pamsoka muisi ya Kanaani na kuyala ntambu zoseri za mitera ya mabwajubwaju, mabwajubwaju aga hapeni mugaliyi, viraa hapeni mlekeziwi kugaliya kwa shaka sha vinja vitatu. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Mushinja sha msheshi mabwajubwaju gakuyi goseri hagaweri mananagala, hamugalaviyi kuwera tambiku ya kulonga mayagashii kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Kumbiti mabwajubwaju ga kwanjira shinja sha muhanu aga mweza kugaliya, mabenu genu hagongereki. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu yandagila aga.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />Namliya shinofu shoseri shashiwera na mwazi. Namtunga kupitira washamshera ama kutenda uhawi.<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />Namumoga nvili za mumasaya genu ama kumoga ndevu zyenu.<verse eid="LEV 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Namlitula shipaku shoseri munshimba mwenu toziya ya kudaya ama kulihanjahanja nshimba ama kulilemba mushimba. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yandagalira aga.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />Nagumuhumba muhinga gwaku kwa kumtenda kaweri mndiyandiya, isi yoseri nayiza kumema undiyandiya na wantu woseri hawaweri wandiyandiya.<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />Mugajimili mashaka gangu ga Kwoyera na kupagohelira Pahala paneni Pananagala. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yandagalira aga.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />Namuwagendera wantu yawatunga kulawa kwa wantu yawawakosiya wantu yawahowiti, toziya pagutenda hangu, womberi hawakutendi guweri muhumba. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />Paguwera kulongolu kwa mzewi gufiruwa gugoloki kumpanana ligoya lyakuyi, su gwenga gunguwiri neni Mlungu gwaku. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yandagalira.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />Handa kwana muhenga muisi yaku nagumtendera vidoda. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Muhenga yakalikala pamuhera na gwenga hakaweri kwa gwenga handa mwenikaya na gwenga hagumfiri ntambu yagulifira gamweni, toziya gwenga guweriti muhenga muisi ya Misri. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu ndo yandagalira aga.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />Gwenga pagupima vintu, kulola viwera na utali gaa ama utopa gaa ama umemiziwu <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />su gwenga gufiruwa gutenderi mizani iherepa na vipimu vyeviherepa. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu ndo yaniwalaviyiti muisi ya Misri.<verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Mwenga mugajimili malagaliru gangu goseri na amuli zyangu zoseri na mugatendi. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ulii yaniwalagalira.<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Azabu kuusu kutenda ukontola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kumgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu. Muntu yoseri pakati pa wantu wa Israeli ama muhenga yakalikala pakati penu, pakamlaviya tambiku mwana gwakuyi yoseri kwa mlungu Moleki, muntu ayu hakalagwi. Wenikaya hawamgumangi mabuwi. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Neni namweni hanimlemi muntu ayu na hanimtuli gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi, toziya kamlaviyiti yumu gwa wana wakuyi kaweri tambiku kwa mlungu Moleki na kwa kutenda hangu kapahumba Muliringu lyangu Linanagala pamuhera na litawu lyangu linanagala. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Handa wenikaya wa pahala panu pawasinda kumlaga muntu ulii, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />neni namweni hanimwazibu muntu ayu yakasinda kumlaga muntu ulii, hanimwazibu yomberi pamuhera na kaya yakuyi na haniwatozi kuhowa, mweni pamuhera na woseri yawaheriti uwaminika kwaneni kwa kumguwira mlungu Moleki.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />Handa muntu yoseri pakawagendera wantu yawatunga kulawa kwa wantu yawahowiti pamuhera na wahawi, hanimwazibu muntu ayu na hanimtozi kuhowa.<verse eid="LEV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Su mulityeki muweri wananagala, toziya neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Mugajimili malagaliru gangu na mugatendi toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu yaniwapunga mwenga.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />Muntu yoseri yakampangira tati gwakuyi ama mawu gwakuyi, muntu ayu hakalagwi. Yomberi kampangira tati gwakuyi ama mawu gwakuyi, su shilii shashimlawira hashiweri shakuyi mweni.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />Handa mpalu pakahumba na mdala gwa wapakwegera gwakuyi, woseri wawili hawalagwi.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />Mpalu pakagonja na yumu gwa wadala wa tati gwakuyi, yomberi hakamsoniziyi tati gwakuyi, su woseri wawili hawalagwi. Shilii shashiwalawira hashiweri shawu weni.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />Mpalu yoseri pakagonja na mdala gwa mwana gwakuyi, woseri wawili hawalagwi. Woseri watenda vidoda vikulu, su virii vyaviwalawira haviweri kwawu weni.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />Handa mpalu yoseri pakagonja na mpalu muyaguwi ntambu yakagonja na madala, woseri wawili hawalagwi toziya watenda shitwatira shashiwera shikalaliru. Shilii shashiwalawira hashiweri shawu weni kwa shilii shawatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />Handa mpalu pakayuga mdala na viraa pakamuyuga mawu gwakuyi, woseri watatu hawalunguziwi motu kuwalaga, toziya watenda vidoda vikulu. Hamtendi hangu su napawera vidoda vya ntambu ayi pakati penu.<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />Handa mpalu yoseri pakagonja na nkanyama, muntu ayu hakalagwi pamuhera na nkanyama ulii.<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Handa mdala pakagonja na nkanyama, mdala ayu pamuhera na nkanyama ulii hawalagwi. Shilii shashiwalawira hashiweri kwawu weni kwa shilii shawatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />Handa mpalu yoseri pakamuyuga dada gwakuyi, muhinga gwa tati gwakuyi ama mawu gwakuyi, muhinga ayu pakajimilirana na kaka gwakuyi na kugonja nayu, shitwatira ashi hashiweri shikalaliru na hakawusiwi kulawa kwa wantu wawu, toziya mpalu ayu kamsoniziya dada gwakuyi na yomberi hakazibiwi kwa shilii shakatenditi.<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />Handa mpalu pakagonja na mdala yakawera mumashaka gakuyi ga kusuma mwazi, woseri wawili hawawawusiyi kulawa kwa wantu wawu, toziya woseri wagalema malagaliru kuusu uhumba.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />Nagugonja na dada gwa mawu gwaku ama shangazi gwaku, toziya womberi ndo walongu waku. Woseri yawatenda hangu, shilii shashiwalawira hashiweri shawu weni.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Handa mpalu pakagonja na mdala gwa tati gwakuyi mkulu ama mpusu, yomberi kankumsoniziya tati gwakuyi mkulu ama mpusu, woseri wawili kwa shilii shashiwalawira hashiweri sha shawu weni kulawirana na vidoda vyawu, su hawahowi pota kuwera na wana.<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />Handa mpalu pakamuyuga mdala gwa mlongu gwakuyi, yomberi kankumsoniziya mlongu gwakuyi, shitwatira ashi hashiweri shihumba, su woseri wawili hawahowi pota kuwera na mwana.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />Mugajimili malagaliru gangu na amuli zyangu, pamjimira isi ya Kanaani kwaniwajega hapeni iwalemi mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Namulikala kwa kufata vitiba vya wantu wa isi ilii yang'enda kuwawinga kulongolu kwenu. Toziya womberi watenditi vitwatira avi, neni nkalaliritwi na womberi kwa matendu gawu madoda. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Kumbiti neni niwalagira kala kuwera mwenga hamuhali isi yawu, neni haniwapanani isi ayi muyikolimlima, isi yayiwera na ulunda na yayiwera na mbotu. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu ndo yaniwatuliti gweka na wantu wa isi zimonga.<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Mwenga mfiruwa mtofautishi pakati pa wampongu na wankanyama walii yawajimiruwa ndiri kwa neni na walii yawajimiruwa kwa neni. Namulihumba maweni kwa kumshinkula nkanyama ama mpongu ama shoseri shashilikwawakwawa pasipanu, shilii neni nishituliti gweka shashiwera shihumba kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mnanagala, neni niwatula gweka mwenga kulawa kwa wantu wa isi zimonga su muweri wantu waneni gweka yangu, su mwenga hamuweri wananagala.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />Mpalu ama mdala yoseri yakawera mganga ama muhawi, yomberi hakalagwi kwa kugumangwa mabuwi. Shilii shashiwalawira hashiweri shakuyi mweni.<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guwagambiri watambika, wana wa Aruni kuwera napawera na muntu yoseri pakati pawu yakalitula uhumba kwa kushinkula mawuti ga wantu wakuyi, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />pamonga pakawera mlongu gwakuyi handa mawu gwakuyi ama tati gwakuyi ama wana wakuyi wapalu na wadala ama kaka gwakuyi <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />ama dada gwakuyi ulii yakawera mlongu gwakuyi, ulii yakayugitwi ndiri. Kwajili ya awa hakawezi kulitula uhumba kwa kushinkula mawuti gawu. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Yomberi pakawera mtambika pakati pa wantu wakuyi, su nakalitula uhumba.”<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />Watambika nawamoga nvili za mituwi yawu kwajili ya kudaya ama ndevu zawu ama kulihanjahanja munshimba. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Womberi hawaweri wananagala kwa neni Mlungu gwawu. Toziya womberi ndo yawalaviya tambiku ilii zyawandavilira handa shiboga kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. Su womberi waweri wananagala.<verse eid="LEV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Mtambika kafiruwa ndiri kayugi mdala yakawera mndiyandiya ama mdala yakawera ndiri luyenja ama mdala yakalekitwi na mpalu, toziya mweni kawera mnanagala. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Wantu wamumani mtambika kuwera mnanagala, toziya yomberi ndo yakandavilira tambiku ya viboga neni Mlungu gwenu. Muvimani maweni kuwera wananagala toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo ulii yaniwatenda mwenga kuwera watambika. Toziya neni ndo mnanagala, ulii yaniwatenda mwenga kuwera wananagala.<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Muhinga gwa mtambika yoseri yakalitula uhumba kwa kutenda undiyandiya, yomberi hakalunguziwi kwa motu toziya kankumsoniziya tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />Mtambika Mkulu yoseri yakatyekitwi kwa kuswagwa lipaki mumtuwi gwakuyi na kuvala nguwu nanagala za utambika, su nakaleka nvili zakuyi kuwera vuluvulu ama kupapula nguwu zakuyi kudaya. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Nakagasegelera mawuti ama kulitula uhumba kwa kwingira pahala mawuti pagawera, ata pagawera ga tati gwakuyi ama mawu gwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Yomberi nakawuka Muliringu Linanagala na kugenda kulikala na wantu walii yawadaya, toziya yomberi hakalitendi mweni kafaa ndiri kwa lihengu lyakuyi, viraa mekalituli humbi Liringu Linanagala. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Mtambika Mkulu kamuyugi mdala luyenja. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Yomberi kalekiziwa ndiri kumuyuga mdala mkenja ama mdala yakalekitwi na mpalu ama mdala mndiyandiya, kumbiti kafiruwa kayugi mdala luyenja kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi mweni, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />su nakiza kuwatenda wahumba wana wakuyi mweni. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yanimtenda mnanagala.<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kumgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />gumgambiri Aruni hangu. Mwiwuka gwaku yoseri muviyiwuku vyoseri vyaviza, ulii yakawera na shidoda shoseri nakasegelera kundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku yakuyi ya viboga. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Muntu yoseri yakawera na shidoda shoseri nakasegelera kundavilira tambiku. Muntu yakawera lwisi ama muntu yakawera shibyeketu ama yakawera na sheni shiharabika ama muntu yakawera na shiwungu shashiwera shitali kuliku ntambu yakuyi, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />ama muntu yakawera na ligulu ama liwoku lyalitenduwitwi, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />ama muntu yakamindika mgongu ama muntu mfupi nentu kuliku ntambu yakuyi ama muntu yakawera na masu mabovu ama muntu yakawera na ulweli wa likuli wa nshimba ama muntu yakawera na upeli ama mpalu yakana mbendi. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Mwiwuka yoseri gwa mtambika Aruni yakawera na shidoda shoseri nakasegelera kundavilira tambiku za kulunguziwa kwa motu. Toziya yomberi kawera na shidoda, su nakasegelera kundavilira tambiku ya viboga neni Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Muntu ayu hakawezi kuliya viboga vyawandaviliriti neni, viraa hakawezi kuliya tambiku ya viboga vinanagala na tambiku nanagala nentu ya viboga. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Kumbiti nakalisegelera lipaziya lilii ama shitalawanda sha kutambikira toziya kawera na shidoda munshimba mwakuyi, su nakiza kutula uhumba Liringu lyangu Linanagala, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yaniwatenda waweri wananagala.<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Musa kamgambiriti Aruni na wana wakuyi pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli, vitwatira vyoseri avi.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s">Unanagala wa tambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />gumgambiri Aruni na wana wakuyi watambika wavipanani ligoya vintu vyavityekitwi kulongolu kwa neni, womberi nawiza kulihigiranga litawu lyangu linanagala. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Guwagambiri hangu. Handa yumu gwa wiwuka wenu muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri hakavisegeleri vintu vinanagala, vintu virii wantu wa Israleli wavityekiti kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu yomberi pakawera muhumba, muntu hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa neni. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />Muntu yoseri gwa shiyiwuku sha Aruni yakawera na ugumbula ama kankulawa ufira nakaliya vintu vya Muliringu Linanagala mpaka pakapona. Muntu yoseri pakamshinkula muntu yakalekelitwi uhumba kwa kushinkula mawuti ama muntu nyakalawa ulenji, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />ama pakashinkula shiwumbi shoseri shashikwawakwawa, shiwumbi shilii shashitenda muntu kaweri muhumba ama muntu yakaweza kumtenda kaweri muhumba gwa ntambu yoseri ilii. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Mtambika ayu hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi na kalekeziwa ndiri kuliya viboga vyaviwera vinanagala mpaka pakoga mashi. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Mshenji paguzyeta muntu ayu hakaweri muherepa. Pa aga yomberi hakawezi kuliya viboga vinanagala toziya ashi shiwera shiboga shakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Mtambika nakaliya shinofu shoseri sha nkanyama yakafuwiti mweni ama kulaguwa na nkanyama gwa kuntundu, yomberi nakiza kulitenda muhumba. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />Watambika wafiruwa wagajimili malagaliru gangu, womberi nawiza kutenda vidoda na kulagwa. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu yaniwatenda waweri wananagala.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />Muntu yakawera ndiri gwa lukolu lwa watambika kajimirwa ndiri kuliya shiboga shinanagala. Ata muhenga gwa mtambika ama mtenda lihengu gwakuyi, walekeziwa ndiri kuliya shiboga shinanagala. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Kumbiti mtambika pakamuhemera mumanda su kaweri gwakuyi, su mumanda ayu kalekeziwa kuliya pamuhera na walii yawayiwukiti mukaya yakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Handa muhinga gwa mtambika yakayugwa na mtambika ndiri, yomberi kalekeziwa ndiri kuliya vintu vinanagala. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Kumbiti handa muhinga gwa mtambika kawera mkenja ama kalekwa na mpalu na kahera mwana na kawuya ukaya kwa tati gwakuyi na kalikala ntambu yakaweriti muwuhinga wakuyi, su yomberi hakawezi kuliya shiboga sha tati gwakuyi. Pamuhera na hangu, muhenga kalekeziwa ndiri kuliya viboga avi.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />Handa muntu yoseri pakaliya viboga vinanagala pota kuvimana, su hakalipi seemu yimu pa seemu muhanu ya samani ya shilii shakaliyiti na kushiwuziya kwa mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Mtambika nakavilekera uhumba vintu vinanagala wantu wa Israeli vyawandavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />kwa kuwatenda wantu wazibiwi kwa ukondola na makosa gawu kwa kuliya vintu vyawu vinanagala. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yanivitenda vintu avi viweri vinanagala.<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku yayijimiluwa ndiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />guwagambiri Aruni na wana wakuyi watambika pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli hangu. Handa muntu yoseri pakati penu ama muhenga yoseri yakalikala pakati pa wantu wa Israeli pakalaviya tambiku yakuyi, payiwera tambiku ya kutula naziri ama tambiku ya ntambu hera, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />su kapati kujimirwa, yomberi hakalaviyi ng'ombi gwashipalu ama mukondolu gwashipalu yakahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Nagulaviya shintu shoseri shashiwera na shidoda toziya hapeni shijimirwi kwa mota yenu. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Muntu yoseri pakandavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya ponga su kujega shilii shagulagiliti ama kulaviya tambiku ya ntambu hera kulawa mushipinga sha wankanyama wakuyi, su kajimilwi yomberi kafiruwa kalaviyi nkanyama muherepa, nkanyama ayu nakawera na shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Nagundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu nkanyama yoseri yakawera lwisi ama shibyeketu ama yakamegekiti pahala ama yakalawa ufira ama yakawera mkita, yakana upeli ama mkita, naguwalaviya kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa kwa motu pashitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Ng'ombi gwashipalu ama kondolu yakawera na shiwungu shimu shitali ama shifupi kuliku ntambu yakuyi, guweza kumlaviya tambiku ya ntambu hera, kumbiti nkanyama ayu nagumlaviya kuwera tambiku ya kujega shilii shagulagiliti. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Nkanyama ulii upalu wakuyi utenduwa, ama upeshuluwa ama umegeka ama ulikituluwa, nakamu nagundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu, nagutenda shitwatira sha tambu ayi muisi yaku. <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Naguwanka kulawa kwa wahenga nkanyama gwa ntambu ayi na kundavilira neni Mlungu gwaku kuwera shiboga. Wankanyama awa wawera na shidoda toziya walikitulwa na hapeni wajimilwi kwa mota yenu.<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />mwana gwa ng'ombi ama kondolu gwashipalu pakayiwuka hakasigali na mawu gwawu kwa mashaka saba. Kumbiti kwanjira lishaka lya nani hakawezi kundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa kwa motu. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Kumbiti nagumlikitula ng'ombi ama kondolu lishaka limu pamuhera na mwana gwakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />Pagundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya mayagashii, haguyilaviyi kwa ntambu yayikutenda gwenga gujimilwi. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Nkanyama ayu kafiruwa kaliwi lishaka liraa lilii, namumsigala mkapa shilawu yakuyi mandawira. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />Su hamuzijimili na kuzitenda amuli zyangu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Namulihigilanga litawu lyangu liananagala, toziya wantu woseri wa Israeli wafiruwa kunguwira neni yawera mnanagala. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yaniwatenda mwenga wananagala. <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Neni ndo yaniwalaviyiti mwenga kulawa muisi ya Misri su neni weri Mlungu gwenu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa dini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />guwagambiri wana wa Israeli. Mumisambu yaneni Mtuwa Mlungu ilii yayitulitwi, mwenga hamuweri na lijojoniku linanagala. Misambu yantuliti ndo ayi.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishaka lya Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />Hakuweri na mashaka sita ga kutenda lihengu. Kumbiti lishaka lya saba haliweri lishaka lya Kwoyera, lishaka ali haliweri lya lijojoniku linanagala. Namtenda lihengu lyoseri lilii pamulikala, lishaka ali haliweri lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Misambu yangu imonga ya neni Mtuwa Mlungu ilii hamuweri na lijojoniku linanagala, hayitendeki mushaka shashitulitwi.<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />Msambu gwa Pasaka haguweri kwa ligoya lya Mtuwa Mlungu, mshenji paguzyeta mushaka sha lilongu na msheshi mumwezi gwa kwanja. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Mulishaka lya lilongu na muhanu, msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekelwa ndiri simika hagwanji. Na kwa mashaka saba hamuliyi Mabumunda yagalekelwa ndiri Simika. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Mulishaka lya kwanja lya msambu gulii, haguleki kutenda mahengu gaku na hagujojoniki kunguwira neni. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Mukila lishaka lya saba, gwenga haguwajegi wankanyama kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. Mulishaka lya saba, hamuweri na lijojoniku linanagala. Namtenda mahengu.<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya Mabenu ga Kwanja</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu. Pamwingira muisi yang'enda kuwapanana, pambena mabenu gakuyi, hamumjegeri mtambika mabenu gwa kwanja kubenuwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Mtambika hakaganyasuli kumpindi kulangalira yagawera gangu, yomberi hakandaviliri mulishaka lya Kwoyera su mpati kujimilwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Lishaka ali pamunyasula kumpindi langalira ya kulaviya ng'anda kulongolu kwa neni hamndaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa ya mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu gwa shinja shimu yakahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Pamuhera na tambiku ayi, hamulaviyi tambiku ya viboga vya kilu mbili za ubumu unama yawuhangayitwi na lipaki lya mizyetuni, lipaki hamundaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu, ununkira wakuyi hauherepeziyi. Tambiku yakuyi ya shilandu iwera lita yimu ya divayi. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Pamberi pa lishaka ali lya kunjegera neni Mlungu gwenu tambika ayi, mwenga mjimirwa ndiri kuliya mabenu gwa kwanja ga mabenu genu, pagawera mawisi ama gakalangwa ama gabanikwa kuwera mabumunda. Ali liwera lilagaliru lya mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyenu pahala poseri pamulikala.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa mabenangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />Kwanjira lishaka pa lishaka lya Kwoyera, lishaka lyamlaviyiti mabenangu ga kwanjana kuganyasula kumpindi kulanguziya gawera gangu, mwenga muwalangi majuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Guwalangi mashaka malongu muhanu pa mashaka saba ga Kwoyera, shakapanu gwizi kundavilira tambiku ya viboga vya syayi neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Kila muntu hakajegi mabumunda mawili ga tambiku ya kunyasula kumpindi kulanguziya gawera gangu neni Mtuwa Mlungu. Kila libumunda lifiruwa linyawiwi kwa kilu mbili za ubumu unama yawulekelwa simika, ubumu awu hamndaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu payiwera tambiku ya mabenangu genu ga kwanja. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Pamuhera na aga, hamumlaviyi wana saba wa wakondolu wa shinja shimu, mwana gwa ng'ombi gwashipalu yumu na wana wa wawili wa wakondolu washipalu. Wankanyama awa hawaweri tambiku ya kulunguziwa pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga na tambiku ya shilandu. Ununkira wa tambiku ayi hayiherepeziyi neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Hamulaviyi mbuzi gwashipalu yumu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na wana wa wakondolu wawili wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Mtambika hakavinyasuli kumpindi kulanguziya viwera vya neni Mtuwa Mlungu viweri tambika ya kulaviya kwa langiru pamuhera na libumunda lya mabenangu ga kwanja na walii wanakondolu wawili. Vintu avi ndo vinanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu vyeni haviweri kwa matenderu ga mtambika hera. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Lishaka liraali hamlaviyi libweru lya kuliwona linanagala, namtenda lihegu. Ali ndo lagaliru lya kufata mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri, mukaya zyenu.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />Pagubena mabenangu gaku mlirambu, nakaka nagubena nakamu mpaka mumbaka mwa malambu gaku pota na kuwuya kumbeli kujojonira vyavisigaliti. Haguwalekeri aga wahushu na wahenga. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa shaka sha syayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu. Lishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa saba hamlitendi lishaka lya kwoyera lyeni gweka, lishaka lya kulihola halibweruwi kwa kugomba talumbeta na kutenda uholuziwu halibweruwi kwa mliru gwa talumbeta na kutenda kuliwona kunanagala. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Namtenda lihengu lishaka ali na ndo mpaka mndaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa kwa motu.<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishaka lya ukolaniziwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />Lishaka lya mwezi agu gwa saba ndo lishaka lya ukolaniziwu. Lishaka ali ndo lishaka lya kuwera na mjojoniku mnanagala. Hamoyi kuliya na kulaviya tambiku yawamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa motu. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Namtenda mahengu genu goseri ga ntambu iraayi kwa lishaka ali. Lishaka ali ndo lishaka lya ukolaniziwu, lishaka lya kuwatendera ukolaniziwu kulongolu kwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Muntu yoseri yakwoya ndiri kuliya lishaka ali ndo mpaka katulwi gweka na wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Muntu yoseri yakatenda lihengu lishaka ali hanimtenduwi muwamu mwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Namtenda lihengu. Ayi lagalira ya kufata mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri na mumakawu genu goseri. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Lishaka ali haliweri kwa mwenga Kwoyera ya kwoyelera nakamu lyeni gweka na hamoyi kuliya. Lishaka lya Kwoyera ndo lishaka lya lilongu lya mwezi agu kwanjira pamihi mpaka pamihi papafata.<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa visasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />guwagambiri Waisraeli hangu. Kwanjira lishaka lya lilongu na mhanu lya mwezi agu gwa saba hammutenderi Mtuwa Mlungu msambu gwa visasa kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba. Agu ndo msambu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Lishaka lya kwanja lya mashaka saba aga, hamuweri na kuliwona kukulu na namtenda lihengu. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba hamlaviyi tambiku zawamupa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa Motu. Lishaka lya nani hamuweri na kuliwona kukulu na kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa. Kuliwona aku ndo kunanagala. Lishaka ali namtenda lihengu.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />Ayi ndo misambu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yayipangitwi yeni hamubweri kuwera ndo lijojoniku linanagala lya kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. Tambika yazilaviwa kwa moto, tambika za kulunguziwa, tambika za viboga na tambika za vyakulanda, kila yumu mulishaka lyakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Tambika azi ndo pamuhera na zilii za ntambu iraayi, tambika zakutenda mapatanu genu na tambiku zyenu za kushongwa ndiri zamndavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />Pa kubena malambu genu hamtendi msambu kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba, Kwanjira lishaka lya lilongu na mhanu lya mwezi gwa saba. Lishaka lya kwanja haliweri lishaka lya kwoyera na mpaka lishaka lya nani. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Mulishaka lya kwanja hamtoli mabwajubwaju ga mitera yenu iherepa, ntambi za mitendi, ntambi zyana mihamba mivuwa na ntambi za mitera yayimera mumbeku mlushemba hamnyawi visasa na mwenga hamtendi msambu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Kila shinja ndo mpaka mtendi msambu agu kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba kwa ligoya lya Mtuwa Mlungu. Ali ndo lagaliru lya kufata mashaka goseri mviyiwuku vyenu. Hamgutendi mumwezi gwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba hamlikali muvisasa. Wenikaya woseri wa Israeli hawalikali muvisasa mushipindi ashi. <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />Shitwatira ashi hashivimaniziyi viyiwuku vyenu kuwera paniwalaviyiti wambuyi wenu muisi ya Misri, niwatenditi walikali muvisasa. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu Gwenu,<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Musa kawabwelera Waisraeli misambu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yayipangitwi.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Koloboyi za pahala pananagala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Kulawa 27:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli wakujegeri lipaki liherepa lya mizyetuni kwajili ya koloboyi su koloboyi ayi yendereyi kuyaka mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Aruni hakayakiziyi koloboyi ayi mngati mwa liringu lya kuliwona, kunja kulipaziya lya lisandiku lya kwamulira su ipati kuyaka kulongolu kwa neni kwanjira pashiru mpaka mandawira. Ali ndo lagalira lya kufata mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Hakazituli koloboyi azi mushintambi sha koloboyi za zahabu iherepa guzituli mashaka goseri ga Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libumunda lyalilaviwa Muliringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />Gutoli ubumu unama, kilu kumi na mbili na kubanika mabumunda kumi na mbili. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Mabumunda aga hagapangwi misitali miwili pambindi pa meza ya zahabu iherepa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kila msitali mabumunda sita. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Kila msitali hagulekeri ubani uherepa su igendi pamuhera na mabumunda aga na kuwera seemu ya tambiku ya kulungiziwa ya kuliholera kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Kila lishaka lya Koyera Aruni hakaipangi teratera mumisitali mabumunda ga syayi kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli handa lagalira lya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Aruni na wiwuka wakuyi gweka yakuyi ndo yawajimirwa kuliya mabumunda aga tembera ndo mananagala nakamu toziya ndo seemu ya tambika yawandavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moto. Ayi ndo yawafiruwa kupata mashaka goseri.<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azabu toziya ya kumuhigilanga Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Lishaka limu galawira mashowanganu kukambi aku pakati pa Mwisraeli yumu na mndemba yumu gwa mawu Mwisraeli yawamshema Shelomiti kumbiti tati Mmisiri. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Lishaka limu mndemba ulii mweni mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Shelomiti mhinga Dibiri gwa likabila lya Dani, kaligilanga na kulipangilira litawu lya Mlungu. Su wantu wamjegiti kwa Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />wamtatira mnumba mpaka palii hayigubutuliwi nfiru ya Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />mmulaviyi mndemba yakigiriti kunja kukambi na walii woseri yawapikiniriti pakigiranga watuli mawoku gawu pampindi pamtuwi gwakuyi na shipinga shoseri shiamuwi kwa kuguma mabuwi. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Na gwenga guwagambiri Waisraeli handa muntu yoseri hayakampangiliri Mlungu gwakuyi ndo mpaka katenduwi kwa vidoda vyakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Muntu yoseri pakawera mweni kaya ama mhenga yakamwigira Mtuwa Mlungu, wantu woseri hawamlagi kwa kumgumanga kwa mabuwi.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />Muntu yoseri yakalaga muntu yumonga ndo mpaka na yomberi wamlagi. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Muntu yoseri yakalaga shigongolu ndo mpaka kalaviyi fidiya. Ukomu kwa ukomu.<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />Muntu yoseri yakamtenda gwapakwegera, ndo mpaka na yomberi katenduwi kulinganira na shiyasi shakamtenditi gwapakwegera gwakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Kammega shifupa na yomberi hakamegwi shifupa, lisu kwa lisu, linu kwa linu. Kila muntu yakamtenda myaguwi ndo mpaka na yomberi katenduwi kulinganira na vitendu vyakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Yakamlaga kanyama ndo mpaka kamlipiri gwingi, kumbiti muntu yoseri pakamlaga muntu yumonga ndo mpaka yomberi kalaguwi. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Lagiru ali limhusu mhenga na mwenikaya ndo mpaka na yomberi kalaguwi. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Su Musa kawagambira Waisraeli woseri aga. Wamjegi muntu ayu yakampangiliriti Mtuwa Mlungu kunja kukambi, wamlaga kwa kumguma mabuwi. Ndo Waisraeli ntambu yawatenditi handa Mtuwa Mlungu tambu yakamgambiriti Musa.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s">Shinja sha saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Liholu 15:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa kulugongu Sinayi, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />Guwagambiri Waisraeli hangu, pamsoka muisi yaniwapanana neni Mtuwa Mlungu kila shinja sha saba isi hayikwoyelerwi nayilimwa kwa ligoya lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Kwa shaka sha vinja sita hamuyilimi isi, hamyali, hampatiri mizabibu yenu na kubenanga viboga vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Kumbiti shinja sha saba hashiweri ndo lishaka lya kwoyera nakamu, ndo kwoyera ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Namyala shoseri pota kuyipatira mizabibu yenu. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Shoseri shashimera gweka yakuyi namshibena pota kwapa zabibu kulawa mitera yawapatira ndiri. Ashi hashiweri shinja sha kwoyeleziya litapaka nakamu. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Ata hangu shinja ashi sha kwoyera nakamu kwa isi haguwapanani shiboga maweni mwenga, wamanda wenu wapalu na wadala, wantu yamuwatuliti mlihengu na wahenga yawalikala muwamu mwenu. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Isi ayiliyiziyi mifugu yenu na vigongolu wa kundundu yawalikala muwamu mwenu.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa vinja malongu mhanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />Hamwalangi vinja saba mala saba na walanga yakuyi ndo vinja arobayini na tisa. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Shakapanu, mulishaka lya lilongu lya mwezi gwa saba lyeni ndo lishaka lya kutendelwa ukolaniziya hammutumi muntu kugomba talumbeta muisi yoseri. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Shinja sha hamsini hamshipanani ligoya kwa kubwera ulukeru kwa wamanda woseri muisi. Shinja ashi hashiweri ndo misambu ya kuholera ya vinja hamsini. Kila yumu hakayiwuyili lunda yakuyi na walongu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Toziya shinja ashi, ndo msambu gwa kuholera gwa vinja hamsini, namyala mbeyu ama kubena shoseri shashimera sheni pota kwapa zabibu kulawa mitera yamuyipatulira ndiri. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Shinja ashi ndo msambu kwa mwenga, hashiweri shinja shinanagala. Hangu hamliyi galii yagamera geni mumalambu.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />Mushinja shoseri ashi lirambu lyalishuwuzitwi ndo mpaka shiwuziwi kwa mweni. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Paguhemera ama kushuwuza litapaka kwa gwapakwegera nagumpunja. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Beyi ya litapaka ndo mpaka ilinganili na vinja pamberi pa kuwuziwa kwa mweni. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Handa vinja vyavihusika ndo vivuwa hagongeri beyi na handa vinja avi ndo vididika hagupunguli beyi, toziya beyi yakuyi hayipimwi kulinganira na viboga vyakakuwuzira. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Namlipunja, su hammuguwiri Mlungu gwenu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />Hangu, hamfati mashaliti gangu na kutenda malagaliru gangu, su mpati kwendeleya kulikala pota madoda muisi. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Isi hayilaviyi viboga vyakuyi mwenga hamliyi na kwikuta na kulikala amu pota madoda.<verse eid="LEV 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Kumbiti pamonga hamuhowi, hatuliyi shishi mushinja sha saba pamonga hatujimilwi ndiri kuyala pota kubena viboga vyetu? <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Su! Neni haniyitekeleri isi mushinja sha sita na yeni hayiwapanani viboga kwa uvuwa kwa vinja vitatu. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Pamyala mushinja sha nani hamuweri mwankuliya viboga vigona na hamwendereyi kuliya hera mpaka shinja sha tisa pamwanja kayi kubena.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya kulikombola lirambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />Lirambu nalishuwuzwa nakamu, toziya ayi ndo lunda ya neni na mwenga ndo wahenga na wamwanja muisi mwaneni. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Ndo mana muisi yoseri hamuweri ntambu ya kulikombola litapaka.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Handa mlongu gwa pakwegera kawera mhushu, kashuwuza lirambu lyakuyi, su, mlongu gwakuyi gwa pakwegera mulihengu lya kulikombola, hakalikomboli. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Payiwera muntu ayu kahera mlongu kana lihengu lya kulikombola, kumbiti shakapanu kawera mlunda na kupata uwezu wa kulikombola litapaka lyakuyi, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />Su, hakawalangi vinja vyavihusika kwanjira pakayishuwuziti na kulipa shiyasi shakuyi, na muntu ulii yakayihemeriti ndo mpaka kamuwuziliri. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Kumbiti payiwera kahera uwezo wa kulikombola, su alisigali mumawoku ga ulii yakahemeriti mpaka shinja sha msambu gwa kuholaziya gwa vinja hamsini. Mushinja ashi, ndo mpaka kalekiziwi na kumwuzilira muntu ulii yakalishuwuziti.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />Handa muntu pakawuza numba yakuyi ya kulikala yayiwera mngati mlushi yalunyawitwi na shibambaza, kwa shinja ashi shoseri hakaweri na uwezu wa kuyikombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Handa numba yaiwera mulushi yalunyawitwi shibambaza ibomolwa ndiri kwa shipindi sha shinja, su, hayiweri lunda ya ulii yakayihemeriti mashaka goseri muviyiwuku vyoseri, pota kuwuziwa mushinja sha msambu gwa kuholera shinja sha hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Kumbiti numba za vijiji vyeni zizyengetwa ndiri shibambaza haziweri pasi pa lagiru iraa ilii lya litapaka, numba azi haziwezi kukombolwa mushinja shimu kumbiti ndo mpaka ziwuziwi kwa mweni mushinja sha kuholera mushinja sha malongu mhanu. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Ata hangu, numba yaziwera mulushi zawalikala Walawi ziweza kukombolwa shaka shoseri. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Payiwera yumu gwa Walawi katendera ndiri nfiruwa yakuyi ya kukombolwa, su, numba yayishuwuzitwi ndo mpaka iwuziwi kwa mweni mushinja sha kuholera vinja ishilini, toziya numba yaziwera mulushi azi za weni Walawi wapanananwa handa seemu yawu kulawa kwa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Kumbiti malambu ga kuwaliziya wankanyama weni Walawi kwa pamuhera, nagashuwuzwa, toziya awu ndo uhala wawu wa mashaka goseri.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwawanda wahushu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />Handa mlongu gwaku kawera mhushu ata kaweza ndiri kulilolera weri mweni pakawera pamuhera na gwenga, ndo mpaka gumloleri weri kendereyi kulikala na gwenga, gumtenderi handa mhenga ama kanamwanja yakawera kwa gwenga. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Pagumuwanda muntu gwa Israeli, Nagumfira kakulipi sha kongera sha ntambu yoseri ilii. Ila gumguwili Mlungu na mlongu gwaku kapati kulikala pamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Nagumpanana uwanda mpiya zakongera ama kumpanana shiboga su kakulipi mota. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, yanikulaviyiti muisi ya Misri kukupanana isi ya Kanani, su na neni weri Mlungu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwapanana wamanda ulekeru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />Handa mlongu gwaku yakalikala pakwegera na gwenga kawera mhushu, pakalishuwuza kwa gwenga, nagumtenda kakutenderi handa mmanda. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Kalikali na gwenga handa ntumintumi yakapananwa lihengu ama handa yakanamwanja. Hakakutenderi mpaka shinja sha ketenda msambu gwa vinja hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Shinja ashi ndo mpaka gumpi ulekeru wakuyi kawuyi kwa walongu wakuyi na uhala wakuyi wa uzewi wakuyi, gumlekeri pamuhera na walongu wakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Toziya Waisraeli ndo wantumintumi wa neni weni niwalaviyiti muisi ya Misri, su, nawashuwuzwa handa wamanda. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Nagumkola mlima mlongu gwaku kwa ukalipa, ila hagumguwiri Mlungu gwaku.<verse eid="LEV 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Kuusu wamanda, wadala na wapalu, guweza kuwahemera kulawa kwa wantu wa maisi gamonga ga pakwegera. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Guweza viraa kuhemera wamanda kulawa kwa wahenga yawalikala pamuhera na gwenga na walongu wawu yawayiwukiti muisi mwa mwenga. Na womberi hawaweri wa gwenga. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Wamanda awa guweza kuwapanana kwa wana waku waweri uhala wawu mashaka goseri. Awa guweza kuwatenda wamanda waku, kumbiti kuusu mlongu gwaku Mwisraeli nagumkola mlima kwa ukalipa.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />Handa mhenga ama yakanamwanja yakalikala muwamu mwenu kawera mlunda na mlongu gwaku kawera mhushu na kumshuwuza kwa mhenga ayu ama yakanamwanja ayu ama kwa yumu gwa walongu wawu, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />kaweza kukombelwa pa kulishuwuza, yumu gwawu gwa walongu wakuyi kaweza kumkombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Mjomba gwakuyi kaweza viraa kumkombola, ama mlamu gwakuyi ama mlongu gwa pakwegera mulukolu lwakuyi, kaweza viraa kulikombola ula mweni handa pakawera mlunda. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Yomberi pakatenda pamuhera na ulii yakamhemeriti, hakawalangi jumla ya vinja kwanjira pakalishuwuziti mpaka shinja sha kutenda msambu gwa kuholera vinja hamsini. Shiyasi sha kutulwa lekeru yakuyi hayilinganira na vinja vyakamtenderiti. Shaka sheni shakaweriti mmanda kwa mtuwa gwakuyi hashipimwi handa shipindi sha untumintumi wa kuwera mlihengu. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Handa walanga ya vinja mpaka shinja sha kuholera sha vinja ishilini ndo shikulu nentu, su hakawuziyi shiyasi shikulu sha beyi yakalipitwi. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Handa vinja vididika vipunguwa pamberi pa kusoka msambu gwa kuholera gwa vinja avi na kumlipa hazilira ayi. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Shaka shoseri shakafira kuwera kwa mtuwa gwakuyi ndo mpaka katenderwi handa ntumintumi yakatulitwi mlihengu kila shinja. Ayu yakamhemeriti nakamtendera kwa ukalipa.<verse eid="LEV 25:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Kumbiti payiwera muntu ayu na walongu wakuyi kakombolwa ndiri kwa njira azi, su wampanani ulekeru wakuyi mushinja sha kuholera sha vinja hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Waisraeli ndo wantumintumi wa neni, toziya niwalaviyiti muisi ya Misri. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s">Matekeleru ga kujimira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Liholu 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Liholu 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, nagulinyawira vinyagu vya wamlungu wa mpayu, namkola vinyagu vyawu vya kusongola pota mpanda pota vinyagu vya mabuwi yagasongolitwi muisi mwenu na kuviguwira. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Mlikoli lishaka lya kwoyera lyaneni na mgohelili pahala pananagala paneni pa kuguwira. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />Handa pamulikala kulawirana na mashaliti gangu na amuli zyangu, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />Haniwatoweli mvula shaka shashifaa, isi ipati kulera mabenu kwa uvuwa na mitera ya mumalambu hagaleri mabwajubwaju. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Kubena viboga hakwendeleyi mpaka shaka sha kubena zabibu na kubenanga zabibu mpaka shaka sha kuyala mbeyu. Hamuweri na shiboga shivuwa na kulikala kwa ponga muisi mwenu.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />Haniwapanani ponga muisi yenu, hamgonji pota kumtira muntu yoseri. Haniwawusiliri wakanyama wakalipa muisi na hapeni kuweri na ngondu muisi ayi. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Hamuwawingi wankondu wenu na kuwalaga kwa ligumba. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Mhanu wa mwenga hawawingi wankondu miya na miya wa mwenga hamuwawingi wankondu elufu lilongu. Wankondu wenu hawalaguwi kulongolu kwenu kwa ligumba. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Haniwatekeleri na kuwapanana wana wavuwa na kongeleka na neni haniligangamaziyi lipatanu lyangu na mwenga. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Shaka sha kubenanga hamuweri mwankali mwakuliya viboga vigona, kayi mpaka mwusiyi vyavisigaliti kupata lupenyu lwa kutula mabenangu gasyayi. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Hanilikali pakati penu Muliringu lyangu Linanagala, viraa hapeni niwaleki. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Hantyangi pakati penu na kuwera Mlungu gwenu na mwenga hamuweri wantu waneni. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, yaniwalaviyiti muisi ya Misri su namwera wamanda aku Misri. Neni nishimega shidiwiru shawawatawiriti msingu mwenu na kuwatenda mgendigendi njoo.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utoza kuusu kulema kujimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />Kumbiti pamuzijimira ndiri amuli zyangu, mwenga hamtozwi. <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />Handa pamzalau mashaliti gangu na kulilema lipatanu lyantuliti pamuhera na mwenga, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />su, neni handendi hangu, haniwakomi kwa kuwajegera lyoga likulu, ulweli wa shifadulu na nshimba kupyupa na kuwatenda muweri lwisi na kuwayondiziya. Hamuyali mbeyu zyenu, kumbiti wankondu wenu hawagaliyi. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Neni haniwawoni, namwenga hamkomwi na wankondu wenu, hamkolwi mlima na walii yawawakalalira.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />Na ata pamtozwa hangu, hapeni mpikiniri, su, haniwazibu mala saba nentu kwajili ya vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Mtiti gwenu hanigumegeri kutali kwa kuzitenda mpindi aku kumpindi kuweri kukamala handa lyuma, na isi yenu pota mvula iweri ikamala handa shaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Hamtenderi makakala genu hera toziya malambu genu hapeni galaviyi mabenu na isi yenu hapeni ileri mabwajubwaju.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />Handa pamwendereya kunema na kulema kumpikinira, hanongeri kayi azabu yenu mala saba shiyasi sha uvuwa wa vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Haniwajegeri wakanyama wakalipa pakati penu weni hanikwiwireni wana wenu na kuwalaga wavigongolu wenu. Na kudumula walanga yenu mpaka njira zyenu zigalambuki gambira shiwala.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />Handa ata pa azabu ayi mwankali kung'alambukira neni, ila mwongera kunema neni, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />su neni, hanilikomangi na mwenga na kuwazibu mala saba nentu toziya ya vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Haniwajegeri ligumba lyeni haliwuziliri kuusu lipatanu lyamlimegiti. Mwenga hamtiri mulushi zyenu, kumbiti haniwajegeri malweri madoda na kuwatula mmawoku ga wankondu wenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Shiboga shenu hanishipunguli ata wadala lilongu watenderi shifinja shimu hera kubanika mabumunda. Hawawabaguliri kwa shipimi. Na ata pa kumalira kuliya mwankali mwana njala hera.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />Na handa ata pa goseri aga mwankali kumpikinira mwendeleya kunema, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />su neni haniwalemi mwenga kwa maya gakalipa na kuwaazibu neni namweni mala saba nentu kwajili ya vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Ndo hamliyi wana wenu, wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Hanipahalibisiyi pahala penu pa kuguwira kulugongu, hanipabomoli pahala penu pakutambikira pa kutumiziya ubani na kuziyasa mauti zenu pampindi pa vinyagu vya wamlungu yenu. Na neni haniwakalaliri nentu. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Lushi zyenu haniziagamiziyi pahala pa mwenga pananagala hanikutendi shiwala na nunkira zyenu ziherepa za tambika nakamu hapeni nizijimili. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Haniyilunguziyi isi yenu hangu, mbaka wankondu yawahamira hamu walikangashi. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Haniwapalasiyi mwenga muwamu mwa wantu wa maisi na kusomola ligumba kwa mwenga. Isi yenu hayiweri ndo ushiwa na lushi zyenu mahami. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Mwenga pamuhera mumawoku mwa wankondu wenu, panu ndo isi hamnemeleri kwoyera zenu shipindi payiwera ntambu ya ushiwa. Isi hayikwoyeri na kunemelera kwoyera zakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Ntambu yayiwera ushiwa hampati shiyasi sheni hasheniweri mulishaka lyenu lya kwoyera pamuweriti mwankulikala hamu.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />Na wamonga wenu yawasigala haniwajegeri lyoga mmoyu mwawu, muisi ya wankondu wawu ata luhamba lyalugulusiwa haluwatungiziyi. Hawatugi gambira muntu yakatuga nkondu ata handa kwahera yakawatugiziya. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Hawaliguwiri vuluvulu handa muntu yakatira nkondu ata handa kwahera muntu yakawatiliziya. Hapeni muweri na likaka lyoseri kuwagendera wankondu wanu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Hamwagamiri pakati pa maisi na isi za wankondu wenu ziwamili. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Handa wamonga wenu pawawera wakomu muisi za wankondu wenu hawayondi toziya udoda wawu na toziya ya udoda wa wazewi wawu.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />Kumbiti handa pawayoya ukontola wawu na ukontola wa wazewi wawu kuusu ugalambuka wawatenda kwa neni na viraa kuusu kulilema kwa womberi na neni, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />wavimani toziya gaa mlilemana na womberi na kuwajega isi ya wankondu wawu, handa nakaka moyu gwawu mdoda pagunanagala na koya ukontola wawu, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />panu neni haniliholeri lipatanu lyangu na Ibrahimu, Isaka na Yakobu na kuyiholera isi ilii yaniwagambiriti haniwapanani.<verse eid="LEV 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Shaka pawawera kunja kulushi lwawu, isi ayi hayinemeleri kwoyera zakuyi panu payiwera ntambu ya ushiwa. Shipindi ashi womberi hawoyi ukontola wawu wa kulema malagalira ga neni na kugakalalira malagalira ga neni. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Kumbiti kwa goseri aga, pawawera muisi ya wankondu wawu, neni hapeni niwaleki ama kuwakalalira ata kuwagamiziya nentu na kuliyasira kutali lipatanu lyangu. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Toziya kwajili ya womberi haniliholeli lipatanu lyandenditi na wazewi wawu, walii yaniwalaviyiti kulawa Misri, maisi pagalola, su neni weri Mtuwa Mlungu gwawu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Aga ndo mashaliti, malagalira na lagiru geni Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti wantu wa Israeli kulugongu Sinayi kulii kwa njira ya Musa.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Lagiru kuusu mafupu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />Guwagambiri Israeli hangu. Muntu pakatula nazili kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kulirapa kumlavilira Mlungu, muntu ayu kaweza kuwusiya kulirapa kwakuyi kwa kulipa shididini sha mpiya shashiwera handa ntambu yaifuta,<verse eid="LEV 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Mpalu gwa vinja malongu mawili mpaka malongu sita hakakombolwi kwa vipandi hamsini vya madini ga feza, shekeli kumi na mbili handa ndo mpalu na shekeli lilongu za mpiya handa ndo mdala.<verse eid="LEV 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Handa ndo mdala, hakakombolwi kwa vipandi kumi na tatu.<verse eid="LEV 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Handa muntu ayu gwa pakati pa vinja mhanu na kumi na mbili hakakombolwi kwa mpiya shekeli ishirini handa ndo mpalu na shekeli lilongu za mpiya handa ndo mhinga.<verse eid="LEV 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Payiwera ndo mwana gwa umli wa pakati pa mwezi gumu na vinja mihamu hakakombolwi kwa shekeli mhanu za mpiya handa ndo mpalu na shekeli ndatu za mpiya handa ndo mhinga.<verse eid="LEV 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Payiwera muntu ayu umli wakuyi ndo nentu ya vinja sitini, shiyasi shakuyi hashiweri ndo shekeli kumi na tanu za mpiya handa ndo mpalu na shekeli lilongu za mpiya handa ndo mdala. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Kumbiti payiwera muntu ayu ndo mhushu na kaweza kulipa malipu gakuyi, su, muntu ayu hakajegwi kwa mtambika. Mtambika hakapimi shiyasi shakuyi kulinganira na uwezu wa yakatuliti nazili. <verse eid="LEV 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Handa payiwera nazili yeni ihusu nkanyama gwa ntambu yeni wantu wamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku, su kanyama ayu kawera shintu shinanagala. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Ijimiruwa ndiri kumgalambula kanyama ayu kwa gwingi yoseri, mherepa kwa mdoda ama mdoda kwa mherepa pakamgalambula kwa kanyama gwingi, woseri wawili hawaweri wananagala. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Handa nazili ayi ihusu kanyama humba na ntambu yayifaa ndiri kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, su, muntu yakamlaviyiti, hakamjegi kwa mtambika, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />na yomberi mtambika hakaamuwi shiyashi shakuyi kulinganira na uherepa ama udoda wakuyi. Ntambu yakafira kuamuwa mtambika, ndo yaifira kuwera. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Kumbiti payiwera mweni kafira kumkombola, su, hakongeri seemu yimu paseemu muhanu ya shiyasi sha nkanyama ayu.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />Muntu pakayilaviya numba yakuyi kuwera nanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, mtambika hakaamuwi shiyashi shakuyi kulinganira na uherepa ama udoda wakuyi. Ntambu yakafira kwamuwa, ndo yaifira kuwera. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Handa muntu ayu yakailaviyiti pakafira kuyikombola numba ayi, su, hakongeri asilimiya malongu ga shiyasi shakuyi na yeni hayiweri lunda yakuyi.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />Muntu pakatula litapaka lyakuyi, yeni ndo uhala wakuyi, kulaviya kwa Mtuwa Mlungu su, shiyasi shakuyi hashipimilwi kulinganira na mbeyu yazitumika kuliyala lirambu ali, kwa kila kilu ishirini za shayili shiyasi shakuyi hashiweri shekeri hamsini za mpiya. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Handa pakalilaviya lirambu lyakuyi mushinja sha kwazimisha vinja malongu, shayasi shakuyi ndo mpaka shilinganili na vipimu vyenu. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Kumbiti handa pakalaviya pa shinja ashi, su, mtambika hakaamuwi shiyasi shakuyi kulinganira na vinja vyavisigaliti kufikira shinja sha kuholera sha vinja hamsini na shiyasi shakuyi shipungulwi. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Handa mweni pakafira kulikombola, su, ndo mpaka kongeri seemu yimu paseemu muhanu ya lirambu ali na shakapanu haliweri lunda yakuyi. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Kumbiti handa kalema kulikombola ama kamshuwuzira muntu yumonga, su, lirambu ali nalikombolwa kayi. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Mushinja sha kuholera sha vinja hamsini sha lirambu ali hakalekiziwi na kuwera lyakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka goseri. Mtambika ndo lyakuyi nakamu.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />Handa muntu pakampanana Mlungu lirambu lyakahemeliti, ndo lyakuyi kayi kwa kuhala, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />mtambika hakaamuwi shiyasi sha lirambu lilii kwa kulinganira na vinja vyavisigaliti kufikira shinja sha kuholera sha vinja hasini na muntu ayu hakalazimiki kulipa shiyasi shakuyi handa shintu shananagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Kumbiti mushinja sha kuholera sha vinja hamsini, lirambu ali ndo mpaka kawuzilwi muntu ulii yakalishuwuziti. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Kila shiyasi hashipimwi kwa shipimu sha utopa sha shekeli kulingana na shipimu sha pahala pananagala. Utopa wa gera ishilini ndo teratera na utopa wa shekeli yimu.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />Iwezekana ndiri kumtula kulongolu kwa Mlungu mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa nkanyama, shilagiru ayu ndo gwakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, kaweri ndo ng'ombi ama kondolu. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Handa yakahusika ndo nkanyama humba, mweni hakamuhemeri kwa kulinganira na ntambu yammupima na hakongeri asilimiya ishilini zya shiyasi sha nkanyama ayu. Handa kakombolwa ndiri, su, hakashuwuzwi kulinganira na vipimu vyenu.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />Kumbiti shintu shoseri shashityekitwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, shiweri ndo muntu ama nkanyama ama shintu shashipatikaniti kwa kuhala, hapeni shishuwuzwi pota kukombelwa. Shoseri shashitulitwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ndo shinanagala nakamu. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Muntu yoseri yakatulitwi na kujegwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu su kalagwi, nakakombolwa, mpaka kalagwi.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />Mukila shintu shimu pakati pa vintu lilongu muviboga, iweri ndo viboga ama mabwajubwaju ga mitera, goseri ndo lunda ya Mtuwa Mlungu, ndo vinanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Handa muntu pakafira kuyikombola zaka yakuyi, hakalipi shiyasi shakuyi na kongera asilimiya ishilini ya shiyasi sha zaka ayi. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Kuusu wankanyama, pawawalagwa, kila nkanyama gwa lilongu ndo kananagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Muntu yoseri kajimilwa ndiri kukosiya handa nkanyama ayu ndo kaherepa ama kadoda pota nkanya ayu nakamu kugalambulwa kwa gwingi. Handa pakagalambulwa kwa gwingi, wakanyama woseri wawili hawaweri wananagala, hapeni wakombolwi.<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Azi ndo lagiru zeni Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa su kawagambiri Waisraeli, kulugongu Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>